(1577065, 211605, 19982, '<td valign="top">I''ll be curious to find out just how long the exposure was on this...  For two reasons:  1) the moon is awfully bright and only needs a short exposure (yet it''s dark here, which means the exposure was even shorter than it might have been), and 2) the moon actually moves fairly quickly across the sky and so even with a quarter second exposure, it will start to blur.<br/> <br/>Don''t get me wrong, I''m not cutting the photo down.  I like it. Giving it a 7. I''m just saying why I''m going to be curious to find out what the actual exposure time was on this.</td>', 'I''ll be curious to find out just how long the exposure was on this...  For two reasons:  1) the moon is awfully bright and only needs a short exposure (yet it''s dark here, which means the exposure was even shorter than it might have been), and 2) the moon actually moves fairly quickly across the sky and so even with a quarter second exposure, it will start to blur. Don''t get me wrong, I''m not cutting the photo down.  I like it. Giving it a 7. I''m just saying why I''m going to be curious to find out what the actual exposure time was on this.', '2005-08-01 01:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
