(1577370, 210983, 14671, '<td valign="top">Loking at this shot on this angle gives me a feeling of vertigo.  Not enough to make me sick but just enought that makes me wanna keep staring into the photo.  Well composed and great colors.  One of the best I have seen in this challenge so far.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'Loking at this shot on this angle gives me a feeling of vertigo.  Not enough to make me sick but just enought that makes me wanna keep staring into the photo.  Well composed and great colors.  One of the best I have seen in this challenge so far.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <10>', '2005-08-01 02:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1577373, 211838, 37320, '<td valign="top">Next stop:  Planet Rock!  Don''t bring the kids cause this partys going to be going past bedtime!  Wahoooo!</td>', 'Next stop:  Planet Rock!  Don''t bring the kids cause this partys going to be going past bedtime!  Wahoooo!', '2005-08-01 02:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1577381, 209895, 37320, '<td valign="top">One of you looks like a 16 year old and the other looks almost a decade older!  Is that the same model?  Great shot- would make an excellent entry in many challenges.</td>', 'One of you looks like a 16 year old and the other looks almost a decade older!  Is that the same model?  Great shot- would make an excellent entry in many challenges.', '2005-08-01 02:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1577384, 211855, 35786, '<td valign="top">I can see why the crop is how it is, but I would suggest cropping even further- just to the right of the middle poster and then you could crop out the others as well. Also the posters make me realize that the image is not level. I wonder if you could have gotten away with cloning them out without a DQ? Other than the posters a gorgeous image. perhaps you could have shot from higher up? Also there is a distracting element between the first spouts from the left that could have been cloned out...  a 6, may bump up later</td>', 'I can see why the crop is how it is, but I would suggest cropping even further- just to the right of the middle poster and then you could crop out the others as well. Also the posters make me realize that the image is not level. I wonder if you could have gotten away with cloning them out without a DQ? Other than the posters a gorgeous image. perhaps you could have shot from higher up? Also there is a distracting element between the first spouts from the left that could have been cloned out...  a 6, may bump up later', '2005-08-01 02:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1577385, 210638, 35786, '<td valign="top">well done! although I think the lighting could have been a little less harsh...  7</td>', 'well done! although I think the lighting could have been a little less harsh...  7', '2005-08-01 02:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
