(1577622, 210837, 34547, '<td valign="top">I almost moved on and I think probably not spending time looking at it means people will miss its qualities. IOW, taking a moment to actually look at it made me appreciate it. I''ve always been attracted nice, smoothe gradients and intersting geometry; something you''ve captured here. Also, I like that the lines aren''t square with the frame. The figure brings a nice break to the stiffness and adds a little color, as well as bringing my eye right to the clear hand. Good luck with this.</td>', 'I almost moved on and I think probably not spending time looking at it means people will miss its qualities. IOW, taking a moment to actually look at it made me appreciate it. I''ve always been attracted nice, smoothe gradients and intersting geometry; something you''ve captured here. Also, I like that the lines aren''t square with the frame. The figure brings a nice break to the stiffness and adds a little color, as well as bringing my eye right to the clear hand. Good luck with this.', '2005-08-01 06:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
