(1577864, 211720, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. The deep brown behind the silvery white of the falls is a great contrast. I like the bit of leaf and I just noticed the man to the bottom right.  IT gives it great perspective.</td>', 'Very pretty. The deep brown behind the silvery white of the falls is a great contrast. I like the bit of leaf and I just noticed the man to the bottom right.  IT gives it great perspective.', '2005-08-01 10:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
