(1578226, 209155, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is very nice...I love the "antique" feel...the tilt is just odd to me...but then, I''m not a big fan of "tilty" images...they always seem somewhat affected to me. This is a truly lovely portrayal regardless...I''m very drawn to the textures and light in this image.</td>', 'This is very nice...I love the "antique" feel...the tilt is just odd to me...but then, I''m not a big fan of "tilty" images...they always seem somewhat affected to me. This is a truly lovely portrayal regardless...I''m very drawn to the textures and light in this image.', '2005-08-01 13:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1578257, 210330, 32754, '<td valign="top">This is just mesmerizing!  I love the color, the mist and the whole composition..well done...the dof beyond the top of the mist is fantastic..</td>', 'This is just mesmerizing!  I love the color, the mist and the whole composition..well done...the dof beyond the top of the mist is fantastic..', '2005-08-01 13:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
