(1578264, 210465, 35804, '<td valign="top">I like this one very much....the colors, the composition, the whimsical aura and those happy little smiley faces....very sweet.</td>', 'I like this one very much....the colors, the composition, the whimsical aura and those happy little smiley faces....very sweet.', '2005-08-01 13:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
