(1578282, 209941, 35804, '<td valign="top">Great compositon and movement...we get just enough information to understand what''s going on but not too much as to spoil the wonderful abstract qualities this image possesses, defintely one of my favorites.</td>', 'Great compositon and movement...we get just enough information to understand what''s going on but not too much as to spoil the wonderful abstract qualities this image possesses, defintely one of my favorites.', '2005-08-01 13:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1578289, 211517, 35804, '<td valign="top">It''s so nice to see a lighting image where the lightning doesn''t fill the entire frame...I love how I can see the storm in it''s entire context...gorgeous colors and wonderful depth..very nice.</td>', 'It''s so nice to see a lighting image where the lightning doesn''t fill the entire frame...I love how I can see the storm in it''s entire context...gorgeous colors and wonderful depth..very nice.', '2005-08-01 13:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
