(1578362, 210726, 24136, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I''ll try to say why but there''s a lot going on... I like that the person is standing on the very bottom edge of the photo - it''s disconnected and ''floating'' but feels grounded at the same time.  I like how cold and crisp it feels.  I like the hard solid lines and the soft blurred circle - there''s a struggle there but it''s playful.  The structure combined with his work boots and pants made me think of an oil rig.  And why would a guy be spinning an umbrella on an oil rig?  I don''t know but that made it intriguing.  Very well done, this one of my top ranked for this challenge.</td>', 'I really like this.  I''ll try to say why but there''s a lot going on... I like that the person is standing on the very bottom edge of the photo - it''s disconnected and ''floating'' but feels grounded at the same time.  I like how cold and crisp it feels.  I like the hard solid lines and the soft blurred circle - there''s a struggle there but it''s playful.  The structure combined with his work boots and pants made me think of an oil rig.  And why would a guy be spinning an umbrella on an oil rig?  I don''t know but that made it intriguing.  Very well done, this one of my top ranked for this challenge.', '2005-08-01 14:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
