(1578467, 211851, 14671, '<td valign="top">The tope part of the building is a little to blown out/washed out.  Perhaps try a -5(-10 or somewhere about there) brightness and +5(+10 or somewhere in there) contrast should make for a nicer photo.  It should make the colors pop a little more without blowning out all colors ad giving you color wash.  Good luck in this challenge. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'The tope part of the building is a little to blown out/washed out.  Perhaps try a -5(-10 or somewhere about there) brightness and +5(+10 or somewhere in there) contrast should make for a nicer photo.  It should make the colors pop a little more without blowning out all colors ad giving you color wash.  Good luck in this challenge. <5>', '2005-08-01 15:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1578468, 210540, 19746, '<td valign="top">Sometimes I love watching darts...purely for the ridiculous commentary!  Nice take on the challenge, perhaps you could have gone with a slightly shallower DOF and a slightly more subject exclusive composition...there''re a couple of little BG curves and elements that are a little distracting.<br/> <br/>Overall a nice idea and a good take on the challenge, but I think you could have executed it a little better.  Good luck, mate.<br/> <br/>Alex (6)</td>', 'Sometimes I love watching darts...purely for the ridiculous commentary!  Nice take on the challenge, perhaps you could have gone with a slightly shallower DOF and a slightly more subject exclusive composition...there''re a couple of little BG curves and elements that are a little distracting. Overall a nice idea and a good take on the challenge, but I think you could have executed it a little better.  Good luck, mate. Alex (6)', '2005-08-01 15:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1578471, 211792, 14671, '<td valign="top">lol I was gonna shoot the falls for this challenge as well but figured someone would be doing it already.  Like the colors and I see you''ve learned (or got better equipment) about the hot air balloon that looks like a moon.  Very impressed this time aoun.  Very crisp and sharp colors.  Nice pleasing appearence and probably one of the best I''ve seen in this chalenge.  Well done and good luck.  Definately a ribbon winner in my books. &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'lol I was gonna shoot the falls for this challenge as well but figured someone would be doing it already.  Like the colors and I see you''ve learned (or got better equipment) about the hot air balloon that looks like a moon.  Very impressed this time aoun.  Very crisp and sharp colors.  Nice pleasing appearence and probably one of the best I''ve seen in this chalenge.  Well done and good luck.  Definately a ribbon winner in my books. <10>', '2005-08-01 15:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1578476, 211845, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very disturbing image.  You did a great job of depicting  any of various maladies connected to the mind.   I would like to see this idea worked with a little more, though.  I don''t think it is the very best it could be.  Not sure how to change it.  If you have a manual setting for long exposure, maybe putting the cap back on between the movement of the face would have givien it a better affect.</td>', 'Very disturbing image.  You did a great job of depicting  any of various maladies connected to the mind.   I would like to see this idea worked with a little more, though.  I don''t think it is the very best it could be.  Not sure how to change it.  If you have a manual setting for long exposure, maybe putting the cap back on between the movement of the face would have givien it a better affect.', '2005-08-01 15:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
