(1579758, 210979, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the balance of darks and lights. A very cool and creative take on the classic bridge shot.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the balance of darks and lights. A very cool and creative take on the classic bridge shot.', '2005-08-02 01:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
