(1579770, 211733, 3669, '<td valign="top">You know, every time I see these light bulb shots done well, I''m fascinated.  I really like them and would like to try it myself some day.  With this one, I like the blue and the trail leading to it.  It is very well done.  The only thing I don''t like is the glare spot under the light bulb.  I''ll be anxious to see how you did this and why that glare spot is there and if it could be avoided without just taking it in post-editing.  Good luck in the challenge.  I hope you are getting good scores.</td>', 'You know, every time I see these light bulb shots done well, I''m fascinated.  I really like them and would like to try it myself some day.  With this one, I like the blue and the trail leading to it.  It is very well done.  The only thing I don''t like is the glare spot under the light bulb.  I''ll be anxious to see how you did this and why that glare spot is there and if it could be avoided without just taking it in post-editing.  Good luck in the challenge.  I hope you are getting good scores.', '2005-08-02 01:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1579777, 211893, 39429, '<td valign="top">Very unique in this challenge.  Wonderful color and display of light.  I love the effect of symmetry without being truely symmetrical.</td>', 'Very unique in this challenge.  Wonderful color and display of light.  I love the effect of symmetry without being truely symmetrical.', '2005-08-02 01:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1579782, 211849, 3669, '<td valign="top">WOW!  When this first pops up on the screen, I get a mild case of vertigo.  This photo is well done.  When I stare at it, I feel like I''m actually riding with you and get scared of what awaits ahead where the road leads to darkness in the trees.  Technically, I thought that perhaps the ATV should be better focus, but I''ve changed my mind.  I like it the way it is.  Good job.</td>', 'WOW!  When this first pops up on the screen, I get a mild case of vertigo.  This photo is well done.  When I stare at it, I feel like I''m actually riding with you and get scared of what awaits ahead where the road leads to darkness in the trees.  Technically, I thought that perhaps the ATV should be better focus, but I''ve changed my mind.  I like it the way it is.  Good job.', '2005-08-02 02:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1579798, 211793, 39349, '<td valign="top">This photo was a complete surprise to me. I love it, 10, 10 and 10!</td>', 'This photo was a complete surprise to me. I love it, 10, 10 and 10!', '2005-08-02 02:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1579802, 211820, 39349, '<td valign="top">Another beautiful shot. I love the water in the fountain. 10</td>', 'Another beautiful shot. I love the water in the fountain. 10', '2005-08-02 02:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1579803, 211838, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very cool!!  Well done.  The only thing I don''t like is the border.  It''s kind of distracting, especially since this is a shot depicting a guitar flying in space.   I''m thinking symbolic wise.  The bold red border, to me, defines a limit...whereas space is limitless.  OK, enough, deep thinking for one night.  All in all, this is a very creative shot and technically well done.</td>', 'Very cool!!  Well done.  The only thing I don''t like is the border.  It''s kind of distracting, especially since this is a shot depicting a guitar flying in space.   I''m thinking symbolic wise.  The bold red border, to me, defines a limit...whereas space is limitless.  OK, enough, deep thinking for one night.  All in all, this is a very creative shot and technically well done.', '2005-08-02 02:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1579806, 211313, 39349, '<td valign="top">Okay, how''d you get the music notes in there?</td>', 'Okay, how''d you get the music notes in there?', '2005-08-02 02:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
