(1580416, 211795, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>Colors are all really dark throughout the photo. There is a lot of noise showing in the lower part of the waterfall.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 Colors are all really dark throughout the photo. There is a lot of noise showing in the lower part of the waterfall.', '2005-08-02 11:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1580420, 211612, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 2/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>There is a bit too much water on the bottom of the photo. Perhaps a tighter crop would have looked better. Nice job on capturing the speedboat moving, but I think a different angle, with a rear curtain flash sync would have given a better overall photo IMHO.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 2/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 There is a bit too much water on the bottom of the photo. Perhaps a tighter crop would have looked better. Nice job on capturing the speedboat moving, but I think a different angle, with a rear curtain flash sync would have given a better overall photo IMHO.', '2005-08-02 11:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
