(1580455, 211501, 15711, '<td valign="top">I didn''t realize you could get such good light effects during the day.  Nice trail! I might eliminate the cars on the right - they seem a tad distracting to me.</td>', 'I didn''t realize you could get such good light effects during the day.  Nice trail! I might eliminate the cars on the right - they seem a tad distracting to me.', '2005-08-02 12:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
