(1581378, 211855, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nice repeated elements, though I find the right hand side a little cluttered.  As I imagine cropping more and more of the photo from the right, I get to two or three fountains in the forground and the photo begins to feel uncluttered to me. On the other hand I am on the extreme fringe of advocating for simplicity in photo composition at this site. <br/> <br/>If this is at University of Texas, I tried my hand with this fountain some years ago and found my own results failed to  capture what I experienced being there.</td>', 'Nice repeated elements, though I find the right hand side a little cluttered.  As I imagine cropping more and more of the photo from the right, I get to two or three fountains in the forground and the photo begins to feel uncluttered to me. On the other hand I am on the extreme fringe of advocating for simplicity in photo composition at this site.  If this is at University of Texas, I tried my hand with this fountain some years ago and found my own results failed to  capture what I experienced being there.', '2005-08-02 21:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
