(1582521, 210425, 29474, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photograph. It is also very sad. I am not sure about the wall sockets - they are a bit distracting, but somehow add to the sense of chaos.</td>', 'This is a wonderful photograph. It is also very sad. I am not sure about the wall sockets - they are a bit distracting, but somehow add to the sense of chaos.', '2005-08-03 03:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
