(1582543, 209155, 20856, '<td valign="top">This better do well.  Although the "futuristic" light switch is a bit of an anachronism.  Would have liked to have seen it cloned out...</td>', 'This better do well.  Although the "futuristic" light switch is a bit of an anachronism.  Would have liked to have seen it cloned out...', '2005-08-03 03:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
