(1582606, 210983, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Some nice light trails, although it seems some of the lights are blown out. In this case, the skewed angle doesn''t really seem to add anything to the image, IMO.</td>', 'Cool idea. Some nice light trails, although it seems some of the lights are blown out. In this case, the skewed angle doesn''t really seem to add anything to the image, IMO.', '2005-08-03 04:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582703, 211842, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot - although an angle I have seen before. The problem is, however, that just because you have used a long exposure to capture the image, does not mean the impact of the photo is created by said long exposure. Thus, you don''t really meet the challenge particularly well. 5</td>', 'This is a good shot - although an angle I have seen before. The problem is, however, that just because you have used a long exposure to capture the image, does not mean the impact of the photo is created by said long exposure. Thus, you don''t really meet the challenge particularly well. 5', '2005-08-03 05:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582705, 209895, 23458, '<td valign="top">Whoever the model is, I''m amazed that she managed to stand so perfectly still.</td>', 'Whoever the model is, I''m amazed that she managed to stand so perfectly still.', '2005-08-03 05:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582707, 210057, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is certainly interesting. I''m not entirely sure about the processing, but it is eyecatching for sure. 7.</td>', 'This is certainly interesting. I''m not entirely sure about the processing, but it is eyecatching for sure. 7.', '2005-08-03 05:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582711, 211016, 23458, '<td valign="top">The star trails need a little context here - though judging by the land in both bottom corners you did this by spinning around rather than a several hour exposure. Still, an interesting attempt. 6.</td>', 'The star trails need a little context here - though judging by the land in both bottom corners you did this by spinning around rather than a several hour exposure. Still, an interesting attempt. 6.', '2005-08-03 05:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582714, 211611, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is beautifully exposed. It might have worked a little better if you''d managed to get simple red streams for the traffic (it looks though you started shooting when the cars were stationary) but otherwise a nice shot. 8.</td>', 'This is beautifully exposed. It might have worked a little better if you''d managed to get simple red streams for the traffic (it looks though you started shooting when the cars were stationary) but otherwise a nice shot. 8.', '2005-08-03 05:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582715, 211851, 23458, '<td valign="top">This shot needs more DOF - try a narrower aperture next time. Otherwise a good attempt.</td>', 'This shot needs more DOF - try a narrower aperture next time. Otherwise a good attempt.', '2005-08-03 05:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582718, 211886, 23458, '<td valign="top">that border is horrible, but I guess it does kind of add to the cartoonish impact of the image.</td>', 'that border is horrible, but I guess it does kind of add to the cartoonish impact of the image.', '2005-08-03 05:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582719, 211793, 9089, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this a 10, even though I think one improvement would be good (although it may be a result of an impossibility or image size).  If the words were just a little more face on to the viewer so as not to strain to try to read the "We will never foget" would just make this image pop.  As it is, I do think it is a fantastic shot of the WW2 memorial.  Best I''ve seen of the DC pics.</td>', 'I''m giving this a 10, even though I think one improvement would be good (although it may be a result of an impossibility or image size).  If the words were just a little more face on to the viewer so as not to strain to try to read the "We will never foget" would just make this image pop.  As it is, I do think it is a fantastic shot of the WW2 memorial.  Best I''ve seen of the DC pics.', '2005-08-03 05:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582721, 211806, 9089, '<td valign="top">Love this picture, 10.  Colors, motion blur make for a great abstract.</td>', 'Love this picture, 10.  Colors, motion blur make for a great abstract.', '2005-08-03 05:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582723, 210057, 9089, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9, I love the shot.  The zoom, the bright light at the end, and the person standing there work great.</td>', 'I gave this a 9, I love the shot.  The zoom, the bright light at the end, and the person standing there work great.', '2005-08-03 05:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582726, 211605, 9089, '<td valign="top">8.  Love the simple and easy composition here.  I will say though that it does ''feel'' like a crop from a larger image.  I don''t know exactly why.</td>', '8.  Love the simple and easy composition here.  I will say though that it does ''feel'' like a crop from a larger image.  I don''t know exactly why.', '2005-08-03 06:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582729, 210738, 9089, '<td valign="top">8.  As a compliment, I was at first thinking that this was a Heida shot, but it doesn''t seem as dark or over-post-processed as her pictures are (no offense to her).  I love the effet you''ve achieved with the surf.  I''m not sure about her belly showing, it seems a little off, but may be because of the small picture size.  Colors are fantastic.</td>', '8.  As a compliment, I was at first thinking that this was a Heida shot, but it doesn''t seem as dark or over-post-processed as her pictures are (no offense to her).  I love the effet you''ve achieved with the surf.  I''m not sure about her belly showing, it seems a little off, but may be because of the small picture size.  Colors are fantastic.', '2005-08-03 06:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582944, 211213, 14671, '<td valign="top">As an abstract photo this is one of the nicer ones but don''t really see how it fits the challenge (not to say that it doesn''t).  For a long exposure it would be nice to see what the actually image is and try and guess how the photographer tried to do it.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'As an abstract photo this is one of the nicer ones but don''t really see how it fits the challenge (not to say that it doesn''t).  For a long exposure it would be nice to see what the actually image is and try and guess how the photographer tried to do it.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-08-03 08:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582952, 211851, 29474, '<td valign="top">I think that this is a little over-exposed. The name board is not reallly visible.</td>', 'I think that this is a little over-exposed. The name board is not reallly visible.', '2005-08-03 08:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582953, 209134, 14671, '<td valign="top">A beautiful steeple shot but the contrast brightness ratio is off.  The tilt of the photo is an odd angle and is very distracting.  The photo does for the most part have some good clarity tho.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;<br/>The reason for giving you a &lt;5&gt; is because it does fit the challenge by being washed out looking.  A normal exposure would not have been so washed out.</td>', 'A beautiful steeple shot but the contrast brightness ratio is off.  The tilt of the photo is an odd angle and is very distracting.  The photo does for the most part have some good clarity tho.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>The reason for giving you a <5> is because it does fit the challenge by being washed out looking.  A normal exposure would not have been so washed out.', '2005-08-03 08:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582956, 210540, 14671, '<td valign="top">Looks to me more like a double exposure then a long exposure.  However I like the way it makes the dart appear to be moving or in transition.  The clarity of the other 2 darts isn''t the greatest and the photo looks like it has been a little oversharpened (the metalic surfaces).  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Looks to me more like a double exposure then a long exposure.  However I like the way it makes the dart appear to be moving or in transition.  The clarity of the other 2 darts isn''t the greatest and the photo looks like it has been a little oversharpened (the metalic surfaces).  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-08-03 08:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582971, 211795, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The focus looks a little off (the leafs on the left are brighter and crisper looking then the ones on the right) and its a little to dark for my liking.  I do like the smokey look off the water tho and the light from above works very well.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Nicely done.  The focus looks a little off (the leafs on the left are brighter and crisper looking then the ones on the right) and its a little to dark for my liking.  I do like the smokey look off the water tho and the light from above works very well.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-08-03 08:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582982, 211454, 14671, '<td valign="top">lol I have the same spinning ball :D  As interesting as this photo is I''m not fond of it.  It fits the challenge well but does very little for me.  It has great color and excellent crispness/sharpness and is very well composed but to me it lacks interest because of the subjects involved with the photo.  Well done and good luck in this challenge. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'lol I have the same spinning ball :D  As interesting as this photo is I''m not fond of it.  It fits the challenge well but does very little for me.  It has great color and excellent crispness/sharpness and is very well composed but to me it lacks interest because of the subjects involved with the photo.  Well done and good luck in this challenge. <7>', '2005-08-03 09:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582989, 211799, 14671, '<td valign="top">Wow very well done.  Very subtle.  Excellent colors and crispness in the shot and well composed.  Wel done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Wow very well done.  Very subtle.  Excellent colors and crispness in the shot and well composed.  Wel done and good luck in this challenge.  <9>', '2005-08-03 09:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
