(1582997, 211759, 14671, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Almost ghost like water and the green light works very well in this photo as I find it adds a certain uniquesness to it.  well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'Well done.  Almost ghost like water and the green light works very well in this photo as I find it adds a certain uniquesness to it.  well done and good luck in this challenge.  <10>', '2005-08-03 09:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
