(1583252, 211806, 4281, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this was achieved by using a hollow tube with reflective inside and then rotating the tube?<br/> <br/>Anyway, it''s fun to see a creative shot in this challenge and even better that you manage to do this with such a cliche subject as a flower. :)<br/> <br/>I hope you do well is this challenge!</td>', 'I''m guessing this was achieved by using a hollow tube with reflective inside and then rotating the tube? Anyway, it''s fun to see a creative shot in this challenge and even better that you manage to do this with such a cliche subject as a flower. :) I hope you do well is this challenge!', '2005-08-03 10:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583271, 211833, 4281, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit disappointed with this picture as the thumbnail looked quite promising. I feel the toning is over the top here and should be much more subtle. Also, I find the overexposed water to be quite distracting. <br/> <br/>But I do like the framing and the subject. Perhaps it would have been nicer to see a bit more above though.<br/> <br/>There seems to be some kind of faulty gradient line at the top of the image. Quite irritating in my opinion.</td>', 'I''m a bit disappointed with this picture as the thumbnail looked quite promising. I feel the toning is over the top here and should be much more subtle. Also, I find the overexposed water to be quite distracting.  But I do like the framing and the subject. Perhaps it would have been nicer to see a bit more above though. There seems to be some kind of faulty gradient line at the top of the image. Quite irritating in my opinion.', '2005-08-03 10:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
