(1583333, 211464, 9089, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, boat really balances the picture and gives a focal point to the picture.  I do wish there was a little separation from the dock, as it blends into it, and loses the real distinctive shape. 7</td>', 'Beautiful colors, boat really balances the picture and gives a focal point to the picture.  I do wish there was a little separation from the dock, as it blends into it, and loses the real distinctive shape. 7', '2005-08-03 10:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
