(1583375, 209155, 9089, '<td valign="top">Has the mental hospital feel with the bed frame, one of the better ''ghostly'' images in the challenge.  7</td>', 'Has the mental hospital feel with the bed frame, one of the better ''ghostly'' images in the challenge.  7', '2005-08-03 10:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583390, 210726, 9089, '<td valign="top">Lines, circles, movement, and hidden people always make for great compositions.  The leading lines of the fence to the left pointing to the umbrella help as well.  Like the shot.  Only improvement would be had it been a woman behind the umbrella (as in a skirt or something, as I don''t picture too many men twirling umbrellas.  7</td>', 'Lines, circles, movement, and hidden people always make for great compositions.  The leading lines of the fence to the left pointing to the umbrella help as well.  Like the shot.  Only improvement would be had it been a woman behind the umbrella (as in a skirt or something, as I don''t picture too many men twirling umbrellas.  7', '2005-08-03 10:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583396, 209838, 40275, '<td valign="top">i love this picture , i am not sure why , maybe because the red is so vivid and the other colors are just boring.</td>', 'i love this picture , i am not sure why , maybe because the red is so vivid and the other colors are just boring.', '2005-08-03 10:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583398, 211677, 9089, '<td valign="top">What a capture.  I don''t know what the white blur is to the top left of the owl, but it reminds me of the bird itself.  I do think a different crop of the picture would help more, as the brighter white streaks to the top right corner draw the eyes away from the owl, and right out the side of the picture.  7</td>', 'What a capture.  I don''t know what the white blur is to the top left of the owl, but it reminds me of the bird itself.  I do think a different crop of the picture would help more, as the brighter white streaks to the top right corner draw the eyes away from the owl, and right out the side of the picture.  7', '2005-08-03 10:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583404, 210657, 9089, '<td valign="top">Pretty harbor scene with good light reflections.  The right side seems a little cluttered and doesn''t add to the picture, maybe do a vertical crop cutting that part out would help.  6</td>', 'Pretty harbor scene with good light reflections.  The right side seems a little cluttered and doesn''t add to the picture, maybe do a vertical crop cutting that part out would help.  6', '2005-08-03 10:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583413, 211758, 30791, '<td valign="top">freaky<br/>this is really scary</td>', 'freakythis is really scary', '2005-08-03 10:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583429, 211611, 9089, '<td valign="top">Really pretty night shot of this.  I do wish the ghost part of the vehicle wasn''t showing on the bottom right corner, and it would just be the lights leading into the picture, but the edge of the vehicle seems almost like a block to letting the eyes go all the way up to Big Ben.  7</td>', 'Really pretty night shot of this.  I do wish the ghost part of the vehicle wasn''t showing on the bottom right corner, and it would just be the lights leading into the picture, but the edge of the vehicle seems almost like a block to letting the eyes go all the way up to Big Ben.  7', '2005-08-03 10:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583433, 209895, 30791, '<td valign="top">i read the title before the picture loaded and thought it was gonna be a girl checking for breast cancer :/</td>', 'i read the title before the picture loaded and thought it was gonna be a girl checking for breast cancer :/', '2005-08-03 10:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583441, 210474, 30791, '<td valign="top">dang<br/>7</td>', 'dang7', '2005-08-03 10:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583550, 210943, 9089, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but even thought the ground is sharp, the blurriness of the swing does not help the picture.  You did it through a long exposure, but it really does not help.</td>', 'Sorry, but even thought the ground is sharp, the blurriness of the swing does not help the picture.  You did it through a long exposure, but it really does not help.', '2005-08-03 11:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583559, 211767, 9089, '<td valign="top">Although the sillhouette looks ok, with the light framing the dog, and the cute tongue sticking out, it is hard to see how this is a long exposure, as it could be done with a short exposure as well.  The lack of the dog''s eyes in the picture and the blurriness of the fur hurts it as well.</td>', 'Although the sillhouette looks ok, with the light framing the dog, and the cute tongue sticking out, it is hard to see how this is a long exposure, as it could be done with a short exposure as well.  The lack of the dog''s eyes in the picture and the blurriness of the fur hurts it as well.', '2005-08-03 11:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583564, 209262, 9089, '<td valign="top">Yes, spin the bottle.  However, the picture doesn''t do a lot to hold my attention.  The grayness is too much, especially when there is just a hint of the green bottle, wish you could see more of the color.</td>', 'Yes, spin the bottle.  However, the picture doesn''t do a lot to hold my attention.  The grayness is too much, especially when there is just a hint of the green bottle, wish you could see more of the color.', '2005-08-03 11:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583571, 210848, 9089, '<td valign="top">I can see what you were trying for in this picture, but it just doesn''t seem to be a picture that makes me want to keep looking at it.  Maybe some more sharpness to the shadows, and a little clearer would help.</td>', 'I can see what you were trying for in this picture, but it just doesn''t seem to be a picture that makes me want to keep looking at it.  Maybe some more sharpness to the shadows, and a little clearer would help.', '2005-08-03 11:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583705, 210448, 40937, '<td valign="top">Whoa this is so creepy! Awesome photo!</td>', 'Whoa this is so creepy! Awesome photo!', '2005-08-03 12:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583714, 210983, 40937, '<td valign="top">Fabu.</td>', 'Fabu.', '2005-08-03 12:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583917, 211785, 39410, '<td valign="top">7 - This is a very striking shot. There are two things I would change. First, the horizon is a little stanted. Second, there is a fair amount of noise, particularly in the shadows on the water and the upper clouds. Perhaps a lower ISO would have helped.</td>', '7 - This is a very striking shot. There are two things I would change. First, the horizon is a little stanted. Second, there is a fair amount of noise, particularly in the shadows on the water and the upper clouds. Perhaps a lower ISO would have helped.', '2005-08-03 13:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583922, 211661, 39410, '<td valign="top">6 - This shot shows a creativity that many of the other shots in this challenge seem to be lacking, but it just does not have much impact to me.</td>', '6 - This shot shows a creativity that many of the other shots in this challenge seem to be lacking, but it just does not have much impact to me.', '2005-08-03 13:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583938, 209155, 39410, '<td valign="top">7 - I really like the way you have made this photo look vintage.</td>', '7 - I really like the way you have made this photo look vintage.', '2005-08-03 13:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583967, 209134, 39410, '<td valign="top">4 - This shot just looks over exposed.</td>', '4 - This shot just looks over exposed.', '2005-08-03 13:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1584029, 211864, 41764, '<td valign="top">nice picture<br/></td>', 'nice picture', '2005-08-03 14:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1584041, 211479, 41522, '<td valign="top">The texture in the rock is nicely captured.  The hint of movement through the milky water is also good.  A little more of an interesting sky would have been nice.  Overall, a pleasant photo.</td>', 'The texture in the rock is nicely captured.  The hint of movement through the milky water is also good.  A little more of an interesting sky would have been nice.  Overall, a pleasant photo.', '2005-08-03 14:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1584056, 211425, 41522, '<td valign="top">This is kind of creepy and sad to me.  Maybe I''m letting the title play on my impressions of the shot.  Nicely composed.  My eye follows from left down to the right.  It does feel like I''m looking at ghosts.  Good work.</td>', 'This is kind of creepy and sad to me.  Maybe I''m letting the title play on my impressions of the shot.  Nicely composed.  My eye follows from left down to the right.  It does feel like I''m looking at ghosts.  Good work.', '2005-08-03 14:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1584060, 211183, 39410, '<td valign="top">7 - I really like this composition and the title of the shot. I wish the lights were brighter as that would just make it stellar. Perhaps more exposure or saturation.</td>', '7 - I really like this composition and the title of the shot. I wish the lights were brighter as that would just make it stellar. Perhaps more exposure or saturation.', '2005-08-03 14:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1584061, 211875, 41522, '<td valign="top">I like the effect the slow shutter speed has on the clouds ... it creates a nice mood.</td>', 'I like the effect the slow shutter speed has on the clouds ... it creates a nice mood.', '2005-08-03 14:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1584069, 211306, 2764, '<td valign="top">What IS it?  I like the way the green reflects on his shirt and I like the color scheme, green and flesh, a contrast between human and alien?  The shadow is cool too.  What if you crop off his pants?  Does that lower bit add anything?  When I cover it up, the strong line of the arm and the shadow arm stand out more.</td>', 'What IS it?  I like the way the green reflects on his shirt and I like the color scheme, green and flesh, a contrast between human and alien?  The shadow is cool too.  What if you crop off his pants?  Does that lower bit add anything?  When I cover it up, the strong line of the arm and the shadow arm stand out more.', '2005-08-03 14:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1584072, 211733, 2764, '<td valign="top">Is the light flowing into the lisght bulb? or escaping from it?</td>', 'Is the light flowing into the lisght bulb? or escaping from it?', '2005-08-03 14:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1584089, 211673, 41522, '<td valign="top">I think the effect you were trying could be spectacular.  There are some interesting colours in this that could create some nice mood.  Is this a church, or castle?</td>', 'I think the effect you were trying could be spectacular.  There are some interesting colours in this that could create some nice mood.  Is this a church, or castle?', '2005-08-03 14:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
