(1584867, 211720, 23053, '<td valign="top">Very impressive location.  I like the inclusion of the man in the shot, as it helps with scale.  Otherwise, I think it would be more difficult to tell just how big this thing is.  In regards to the rest of your shot, I think the color is nice, the sharpness is right where it needs to be, and the composition is pleasing.  The only thing that bothers me is the group of leaves in the lower left.  If they were close enough to you, perhpas you can just move them out of the way a bit on a futurue trip to the falls.</td>', 'Very impressive location.  I like the inclusion of the man in the shot, as it helps with scale.  Otherwise, I think it would be more difficult to tell just how big this thing is.  In regards to the rest of your shot, I think the color is nice, the sharpness is right where it needs to be, and the composition is pleasing.  The only thing that bothers me is the group of leaves in the lower left.  If they were close enough to you, perhpas you can just move them out of the way a bit on a futurue trip to the falls.', '2005-08-03 19:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1584879, 211831, 23053, '<td valign="top">I think you have made a cool effect - double exposure to show a change in colors.  But, it seems that your intent is lost a bit, as it looks like a purple crayon at first glance.</td>', 'I think you have made a cool effect - double exposure to show a change in colors.  But, it seems that your intent is lost a bit, as it looks like a purple crayon at first glance.', '2005-08-03 19:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
