(1585249, 210882, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 2/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Very nice exposure on this night shot. Great use of lines to lead in to the photograph. The building on the left looks like it is going to fall over, and maybe a little more river on bottom so that is starts at the corner would make a better use of the line.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 2/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Very nice exposure on this night shot. Great use of lines to lead in to the photograph. The building on the left looks like it is going to fall over, and maybe a little more river on bottom so that is starts at the corner would make a better use of the line.', '2005-08-03 22:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
