(1586275, 209906, 15711, '<td valign="top">The vivid contrast between the white pinkish red and deep blue is lovely - very abstract. Without the title, i''d have no idea what it was, but in this challenge, I think that''s ok.</td>', 'The vivid contrast between the white pinkish red and deep blue is lovely - very abstract. Without the title, i''d have no idea what it was, but in this challenge, I think that''s ok.', '2005-08-04 10:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586278, 211783, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m surprized we didn''t see more bikes.  Yours is a nice change! The shadowing on the grass is a tad distracting but I like the striped effect on the sleeve, helmet and shorts of the bike rider.</td>', 'I''m surprized we didn''t see more bikes.  Yours is a nice change! The shadowing on the grass is a tad distracting but I like the striped effect on the sleeve, helmet and shorts of the bike rider.', '2005-08-04 10:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586281, 210905, 14671, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of the tilt.  It is unique but adds nothing to this photo IMO.  The photo is pretty cool tho as it look more like a model the real because of the clarity or smoothness of the photo.  Interesting and well done.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I''m not fond of the tilt.  It is unique but adds nothing to this photo IMO.  The photo is pretty cool tho as it look more like a model the real because of the clarity or smoothness of the photo.  Interesting and well done.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-08-04 10:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586282, 210816, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely golden image. The reflection adds leading lines up to the bridge itself.</td>', 'Lovely golden image. The reflection adds leading lines up to the bridge itself.', '2005-08-04 10:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586284, 209156, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really interesting. Reminds me of Jack Nicholson in "The Shining." I like the cloudy effect in the background and the sepia tone.</td>', 'Really interesting. Reminds me of Jack Nicholson in "The Shining." I like the cloudy effect in the background and the sepia tone.', '2005-08-04 10:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586286, 211464, 14671, '<td valign="top">Oh no, not another sunset photo.  wheres the baby bug macro???  lol j/k  Beautiful shot.  I really like the silohouette against the water and not much quality loss in the resize.  A nice thin border could have added that little extra something to this photo but fine either way.   Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Oh no, not another sunset photo.  wheres the baby bug macro???  lol j/k  Beautiful shot.  I really like the silohouette against the water and not much quality loss in the resize.  A nice thin border could have added that little extra something to this photo but fine either way.   Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <7>', '2005-08-04 10:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586287, 211860, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this but I think it might be more effective if it were a closer zoom. Spider webs are great natural architecture and make for wonderful photos.</td>', 'I like this but I think it might be more effective if it were a closer zoom. Spider webs are great natural architecture and make for wonderful photos.', '2005-08-04 10:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586288, 211805, 15711, '<td valign="top">The white eye is creepy and adds to the photo.</td>', 'The white eye is creepy and adds to the photo.', '2005-08-04 10:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586291, 211644, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the cards on a green felt or black table and it might look more authentic. The movement of the hands is well done though.  I''m all in!!!</td>', 'I''d like to see the cards on a green felt or black table and it might look more authentic. The movement of the hands is well done though.  I''m all in!!!', '2005-08-04 10:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586292, 211431, 19961, '<td valign="top">Love the title! Well done.</td>', 'Love the title! Well done.', '2005-08-04 10:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586295, 211550, 15711, '<td valign="top">Perfect title for the shot.  Nice golden quality to the image.</td>', 'Perfect title for the shot.  Nice golden quality to the image.', '2005-08-04 10:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586298, 211824, 19961, '<td valign="top">Very cool! Well done to get the body so sharp and all in all a superb picture!</td>', 'Very cool! Well done to get the body so sharp and all in all a superb picture!', '2005-08-04 10:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586300, 209914, 15711, '<td valign="top">Velvety water and blue tones are pretty, but it doesn''t have a whole lot of oomph.  Maybe a boat, or a person walking by might have added that extra bit of punch that would really make it a ribbon winner.</td>', 'Velvety water and blue tones are pretty, but it doesn''t have a whole lot of oomph.  Maybe a boat, or a person walking by might have added that extra bit of punch that would really make it a ribbon winner.', '2005-08-04 10:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586301, 210465, 15711, '<td valign="top">Good contrast with the white background. The box in the back left balances it without being distracting.</td>', 'Good contrast with the white background. The box in the back left balances it without being distracting.', '2005-08-04 10:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586302, 210474, 15711, '<td valign="top">Is it grass in the foreground?   That''s a touch distracting, but I love the stars and the sweep of the bright white light.</td>', 'Is it grass in the foreground?   That''s a touch distracting, but I love the stars and the sweep of the bright white light.', '2005-08-04 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586309, 210371, 15711, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I don''t find it  an overly captivating  shot - maybe it''s the poster that is busy and a bit distracting. I like the figure on the bench and the interesting light and dark squares of the floor. Maybe if it were shot from a different angle without that as the background? Hmmmm - not sure.</td>', 'Unfortunately, I don''t find it  an overly captivating  shot - maybe it''s the poster that is busy and a bit distracting. I like the figure on the bench and the interesting light and dark squares of the floor. Maybe if it were shot from a different angle without that as the background? Hmmmm - not sure.', '2005-08-04 10:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586311, 211759, 19961, '<td valign="top">This is very nice. Perhaps a bit dark, but I like the effect.</td>', 'This is very nice. Perhaps a bit dark, but I like the effect.', '2005-08-04 10:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586312, 210804, 30605, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition. I recongnize the Pink Floy Animal power plant :). I assume you pointed the camera at 2 different thing; very well done. Sky is a bit dull though, but great shot anyway.</td>', 'Very interesting composition. I recongnize the Pink Floy Animal power plant :). I assume you pointed the camera at 2 different thing; very well done. Sky is a bit dull though, but great shot anyway.', '2005-08-04 10:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586314, 210726, 30605, '<td valign="top">Very clean, and original. Interesting composition.</td>', 'Very clean, and original. Interesting composition.', '2005-08-04 10:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586315, 211831, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very subtle with the red and blue turning to purple. The glare on the package is a tad harsh, but with this challenge, it''s probably ok.</td>', 'Very subtle with the red and blue turning to purple. The glare on the package is a tad harsh, but with this challenge, it''s probably ok.', '2005-08-04 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586318, 211574, 30605, '<td valign="top">Very well executed. Dont'' know how you managed to get both face so saturated; there is so many bad double exposure shot in this challenge.</td>', 'Very well executed. Dont'' know how you managed to get both face so saturated; there is so many bad double exposure shot in this challenge.', '2005-08-04 10:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586319, 210441, 15711, '<td valign="top">This would be cute in a kid''s room. Well executed but being a cartoon-ish doll, it doesn''t have quite the appeal that maybe another object would have doing the same thing.  Maybe that''s just my perspective.  Good luck in the challange!</td>', 'This would be cute in a kid''s room. Well executed but being a cartoon-ish doll, it doesn''t have quite the appeal that maybe another object would have doing the same thing.  Maybe that''s just my perspective.  Good luck in the challange!', '2005-08-04 10:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586320, 211816, 19961, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I love these water pictures!</td>', 'Very pretty.  I love these water pictures!', '2005-08-04 10:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586322, 211786, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a day shot amidst all of the night lights.  The colors are very pretty and you certainly captured the movment of the car.</td>', 'Nice to see a day shot amidst all of the night lights.  The colors are very pretty and you certainly captured the movment of the car.', '2005-08-04 10:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586327, 211871, 15711, '<td valign="top">YIKES - is Norman Bates resurrected???  Good use of movement for the challenge but the colors are so muted and subtle that it doesn''t have alot of punch for me.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'YIKES - is Norman Bates resurrected???  Good use of movement for the challenge but the colors are so muted and subtle that it doesn''t have alot of punch for me.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-08-04 10:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586329, 211771, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish this were a larger image. It certainly meets the challenge criteria.</td>', 'I wish this were a larger image. It certainly meets the challenge criteria.', '2005-08-04 10:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586331, 211731, 30605, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Very bright shot. Wonder if those two people were there when the train passed. Great execution.</td>', 'Great composition. Very bright shot. Wonder if those two people were there when the train passed. Great execution.', '2005-08-04 10:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586334, 211213, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty sweeping colors but it doesn''t have the pizazz that really captivates the viewer. Maybe if there were a single object with some movement as well???  I do love the deep dusty purple hues though.</td>', 'Pretty sweeping colors but it doesn''t have the pizazz that really captivates the viewer. Maybe if there were a single object with some movement as well???  I do love the deep dusty purple hues though.', '2005-08-04 10:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586335, 211199, 30605, '<td valign="top">It''s always nice to see a good highway shot like this,</td>', 'It''s always nice to see a good highway shot like this,', '2005-08-04 10:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586338, 211705, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice movement capture but for some reason it''s not that interesting to my eye. The reflection is good.  Hmmmm I don''t know. Maybe it''s just me.</td>', 'Nice movement capture but for some reason it''s not that interesting to my eye. The reflection is good.  Hmmmm I don''t know. Maybe it''s just me.', '2005-08-04 10:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586340, 211721, 19961, '<td valign="top">It is very dark, so hard to judge :(</td>', 'It is very dark, so hard to judge :(', '2005-08-04 10:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586342, 211849, 15711, '<td valign="top">Fun use of leading lines as well. Great vivid colors. 7</td>', 'Fun use of leading lines as well. Great vivid colors. 7', '2005-08-04 10:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586344, 210474, 30605, '<td valign="top">Very nice with stars and all. Good composition.</td>', 'Very nice with stars and all. Good composition.', '2005-08-04 10:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586345, 211892, 15711, '<td valign="top">Good vivid colors, but without the title, I wouldn''t know for sure what it was. It meets the challenge criteria, but maybe lacks a little of the POP that really stirs the viewer.</td>', 'Good vivid colors, but without the title, I wouldn''t know for sure what it was. It meets the challenge criteria, but maybe lacks a little of the POP that really stirs the viewer.', '2005-08-04 10:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586350, 211855, 30605, '<td valign="top">Likes the composition. Very clean, looks like computer generated.</td>', 'Likes the composition. Very clean, looks like computer generated.', '2005-08-04 10:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586352, 211898, 15711, '<td valign="top">The double figure certainly works, but the setting in which it is done isn''t that interesting. The posters, calendar and golf club are a bit distracting from the idea. Maybe if you staged it and cleared away the clutter, the simplicity would have really given it more effect.  I hope you find this helpful.  Good luck in the challange.</td>', 'The double figure certainly works, but the setting in which it is done isn''t that interesting. The posters, calendar and golf club are a bit distracting from the idea. Maybe if you staged it and cleared away the clutter, the simplicity would have really given it more effect.  I hope you find this helpful.  Good luck in the challange.', '2005-08-04 10:56:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1586353, 211824, 15711, '<td valign="top">You captured the movement of the wings well.</td>', 'You captured the movement of the wings well.', '2005-08-04 10:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586354, 211745, 30605, '<td valign="top">Great composition along with the long exposure gives a good sense of motion and speed.</td>', 'Great composition along with the long exposure gives a good sense of motion and speed.', '2005-08-04 10:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586356, 210561, 15711, '<td valign="top">The purple and green are a nice contrast but this doesn''t have quite enough to captivate the viewer in my opinion.</td>', 'The purple and green are a nice contrast but this doesn''t have quite enough to captivate the viewer in my opinion.', '2005-08-04 10:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586357, 211673, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the little stick lines that the movement creates. Looks like a castle in the background.</td>', 'I love the little stick lines that the movement creates. Looks like a castle in the background.', '2005-08-04 10:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586359, 211491, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good execution. Communicate the sense of speed.</td>', 'Good execution. Communicate the sense of speed.', '2005-08-04 11:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586361, 211674, 15711, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.. This doesn''t really intrigue the viewer but maybe it''s just mee.  I like the subtle light but it''s probably TOO dark to really grab ya. Hmmmm Hope this is a helpful critique.</td>', 'Hmmm.. This doesn''t really intrigue the viewer but maybe it''s just mee.  I like the subtle light but it''s probably TOO dark to really grab ya. Hmmmm Hope this is a helpful critique.', '2005-08-04 11:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586363, 211357, 30605, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what is it, but looks nice. Makes a nice abstract.</td>', 'Don''t know what is it, but looks nice. Makes a nice abstract.', '2005-08-04 11:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586364, 211870, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I would remove the pictures on the wall for a bit more simplicity and no distraction from the movement of the figures. I like the title and the blue light in the window.</td>', 'I think I would remove the pictures on the wall for a bit more simplicity and no distraction from the movement of the figures. I like the title and the blue light in the window.', '2005-08-04 11:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586366, 211714, 30605, '<td valign="top">Big noise probleme here. Otherwise, good picture.</td>', 'Big noise probleme here. Otherwise, good picture.', '2005-08-04 11:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586374, 210692, 30605, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a mistake than intentional to me.</td>', 'Looks more like a mistake than intentional to me.', '2005-08-04 11:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586376, 210943, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the movement of the swing going back and forth and it might really have some punch.</td>', 'I''d like to see the movement of the swing going back and forth and it might really have some punch.', '2005-08-04 11:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586381, 211842, 30605, '<td valign="top">This challenge to me was more about motion than just plain long exposure of static object. Still, I upgrade you to 5 since your shot is well compose and frame.</td>', 'This challenge to me was more about motion than just plain long exposure of static object. Still, I upgrade you to 5 since your shot is well compose and frame.', '2005-08-04 11:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586382, 210441, 31443, '<td valign="top">Never thought I would like an entry of a toy, this one is rather clever!</td>', 'Never thought I would like an entry of a toy, this one is rather clever!', '2005-08-04 11:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586385, 210141, 30605, '<td valign="top">This challenge was more about motion that static objec to my understanding. Your photo is kind of OK, but lacks interest in this challenge.</td>', 'This challenge was more about motion that static objec to my understanding. Your photo is kind of OK, but lacks interest in this challenge.', '2005-08-04 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586390, 211845, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice effort. This is technically very difficult to acheive. More often thatn not, this kind of shot ends up blurred/fuzzy.</td>', 'Nice effort. This is technically very difficult to acheive. More often thatn not, this kind of shot ends up blurred/fuzzy.', '2005-08-04 11:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586399, 211875, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, bright light coming from window spoils this a little, nice contrast as well</td>', 'Nice colors, bright light coming from window spoils this a little, nice contrast as well', '2005-08-04 11:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586400, 210946, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but result not quite good enough. Only left head not too blury. Guess it''s hard to get a dof to stand still.</td>', 'Nice concept but result not quite good enough. Only left head not too blury. Guess it''s hard to get a dof to stand still.', '2005-08-04 11:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586404, 211467, 30605, '<td valign="top">I don''t get any sense o long exposure in here. Good picture though.</td>', 'I don''t get any sense o long exposure in here. Good picture though.', '2005-08-04 11:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586411, 211311, 30605, '<td valign="top">I don''t get any sense of long exposure in here except maybe the blown out background.</td>', 'I don''t get any sense of long exposure in here except maybe the blown out background.', '2005-08-04 11:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586412, 210121, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and good composition.</td>', 'Nice concept and good composition.', '2005-08-04 11:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586417, 211183, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Wheel really looks like it''s speeding madly.</td>', 'Nice shot. Wheel really looks like it''s speeding madly.', '2005-08-04 11:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586419, 211169, 30605, '<td valign="top">The best water shot of this challenge. Exposure not too long or too short. GReat composition and lighting is really good.</td>', 'The best water shot of this challenge. Exposure not too long or too short. GReat composition and lighting is really good.', '2005-08-04 11:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586431, 211777, 30605, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of speed communicated here. Suffers a bit from over exposition though.</td>', 'I like the sense of speed communicated here. Suffers a bit from over exposition though.', '2005-08-04 11:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586447, 210057, 27471, '<td valign="top">very Int</td>', 'very Int', '2005-08-04 11:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586448, 211313, 27471, '<td valign="top">8</td>', '8', '2005-08-04 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586451, 209697, 27471, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2005-08-04 11:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586453, 210821, 27471, '<td valign="top">First place !!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'First place !!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2005-08-04 11:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586501, 210905, 41522, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  The angle of the shot gives a more dynamic feel to the motion ... it sort of adds to the feeling of speed more than I think a level shot would have.  Not keen on the square crop though.</td>', 'I like this shot.  The angle of the shot gives a more dynamic feel to the motion ... it sort of adds to the feeling of speed more than I think a level shot would have.  Not keen on the square crop though.', '2005-08-04 12:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586507, 210905, 23614, '<td valign="top">You should have tilted a little more. ;-) Would also have been nice to see some yellow in your picture. I like yellow!</td>', 'You should have tilted a little more. ;-) Would also have been nice to see some yellow in your picture. I like yellow!', '2005-08-04 12:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586563, 211679, 31443, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2005-08-04 12:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586600, 211760, 31443, '<td valign="top">The water seems almost frozen, hope your model didn''t slip on those rocks! Well done. Hlýtur að vera íslenskur þari!</td>', 'The water seems almost frozen, hope your model didn''t slip on those rocks! Well done. Hlýtur að vera íslenskur þari!', '2005-08-04 12:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586626, 211792, 31738, '<td valign="top">Amazing. That''s all I can say.</td>', 'Amazing. That''s all I can say.', '2005-08-04 12:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586723, 211677, 31443, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is amazing! Perfect moment...</td>', 'Wow! This is amazing! Perfect moment...', '2005-08-04 13:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586741, 211313, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great shot...</td>', 'Great shot...', '2005-08-04 13:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586823, 210425, 31213, '<td valign="top">Wow, pretty spooky.  Very emotional.  I like it! 10</td>', 'Wow, pretty spooky.  Very emotional.  I like it! 10', '2005-08-04 14:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586830, 211213, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very abstract...I usually find that when I get really "out there", the pics suffer with these voters....it only will take once or twice to learn that though!  :)  Good luck!</td>', 'Very abstract...I usually find that when I get really "out there", the pics suffer with these voters....it only will take once or twice to learn that though!  :)  Good luck!', '2005-08-04 14:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586831, 210441, 41522, '<td valign="top">This is a fun shot.  Fairly well executed.  The bright spot in the middle where three positions of the doll all have the hair is a bit of an eye grabber.</td>', 'This is a fun shot.  Fairly well executed.  The bright spot in the middle where three positions of the doll all have the hair is a bit of an eye grabber.', '2005-08-04 14:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586836, 211492, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very original and unique.  I''d love to see a spec more of her face...but 1/4 is technically enough.  I think that maybe taking a little more of the room would have brought a little context....its hard to tell its a bedroom.  I like it though. 7</td>', 'Very original and unique.  I''d love to see a spec more of her face...but 1/4 is technically enough.  I think that maybe taking a little more of the room would have brought a little context....its hard to tell its a bedroom.  I like it though. 7', '2005-08-04 14:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586839, 211440, 41522, '<td valign="top">A pretty good shot.  The motion of the people is good but I wish I could see more of the movement of the escalator.  The reflection on the glass almost makes it look like the escaltor is not moving.</td>', 'A pretty good shot.  The motion of the people is good but I wish I could see more of the movement of the escalator.  The reflection on the glass almost makes it look like the escaltor is not moving.', '2005-08-04 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586841, 210158, 31213, '<td valign="top">L O L.  This is a riot!</td>', 'L O L.  This is a riot!', '2005-08-04 14:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586845, 210448, 31213, '<td valign="top">Some may complain about the obvious burning/dodging.  I think it almost works....adding to the dreaminess of the pic.  Its almost like a scene out of a movie....like "What Lies Beneath".....Sorry, I''m a film major....this is how I think :)</td>', 'Some may complain about the obvious burning/dodging.  I think it almost works....adding to the dreaminess of the pic.  Its almost like a scene out of a movie....like "What Lies Beneath".....Sorry, I''m a film major....this is how I think :)', '2005-08-04 14:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586846, 211550, 41522, '<td valign="top">The slow shutter speed has given a really nice illusion ... wondering if you wished you had ket this for the Illusions Challange?  Overall, nicely done.  I really like how almost everything is a shade of yellow/orange.  There is a blue spot on the bottom right that I would have liked to have seen removed but that is a minor distraction only.</td>', 'The slow shutter speed has given a really nice illusion ... wondering if you wished you had ket this for the Illusions Challange?  Overall, nicely done.  I really like how almost everything is a shade of yellow/orange.  There is a blue spot on the bottom right that I would have liked to have seen removed but that is a minor distraction only.', '2005-08-04 14:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586852, 210987, 31213, '<td valign="top">Uh oh, an uneven horizon.....if theres anythingg you should know about DPC voters is that uneven horizons RAREKY fly.   :)  Good luck, your gunna need it!</td>', 'Uh oh, an uneven horizon.....if theres anythingg you should know about DPC voters is that uneven horizons RAREKY fly.   :)  Good luck, your gunna need it!', '2005-08-04 14:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586854, 210946, 31213, '<td valign="top">LOL....picture quality.  Poor.  Originality and humor. Excellent!  Also, it was advanced editing so you should have blackened out the light stuff in the background!</td>', 'LOL....picture quality.  Poor.  Originality and humor. Excellent!  Also, it was advanced editing so you should have blackened out the light stuff in the background!', '2005-08-04 14:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586856, 211214, 31213, '<td valign="top">A little too crazy in my opinion.  I dont know how you took this.....through glass?  But,  I think that you tried a bit too hard.  The scenery looks pretty enough as it is without the circle and reflection stuff obscuring it.</td>', 'A little too crazy in my opinion.  I dont know how you took this.....through glass?  But,  I think that you tried a bit too hard.  The scenery looks pretty enough as it is without the circle and reflection stuff obscuring it.', '2005-08-04 14:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586858, 210440, 31213, '<td valign="top">Love the brick wall....I love brick walls....very easy to photograph.  Nice job.</td>', 'Love the brick wall....I love brick walls....very easy to photograph.  Nice job.', '2005-08-04 14:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
