(1586924, 210513, 41522, '<td valign="top">While this is a nice enough photo, it looses marks for me based on the challenge topic "longer than usual exposure for dramatic effect."  This looks correctly exposed to me.  So, good photo but slightly misses the mark for the challenge.</td>', 'While this is a nice enough photo, it looses marks for me based on the challenge topic "longer than usual exposure for dramatic effect."  This looks correctly exposed to me.  So, good photo but slightly misses the mark for the challenge.', '2005-08-04 15:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586929, 211493, 41522, '<td valign="top">A nice enough waterfall photo.  I would have liked to have seen a little more contrast on the rocks.</td>', 'A nice enough waterfall photo.  I would have liked to have seen a little more contrast on the rocks.', '2005-08-04 15:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586932, 211306, 41522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I do like the effect.  I think it would have been cool to have had additional help on this photo so that the model could keep both hands in the frame to keep the illusion a little more intact.  JMO.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I do like the effect.  I think it would have been cool to have had additional help on this photo so that the model could keep both hands in the frame to keep the illusion a little more intact.  JMO.', '2005-08-04 15:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586936, 211464, 41522, '<td valign="top">A beautiful sunset.  Wonderfull colours.  It appears to me that you used the "correct" exposure for the moment rather than a longer than normal exposure for dramatic effect.</td>', 'A beautiful sunset.  Wonderfull colours.  It appears to me that you used the "correct" exposure for the moment rather than a longer than normal exposure for dramatic effect.', '2005-08-04 15:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586938, 211793, 41522, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective on this image.  I''m not really seeing a longer than normal expsoure for the moment.  No doubt a long exposure was used, but not longer than normal for the circumstances, IMHO.</td>', 'Interesting perspective on this image.  I''m not really seeing a longer than normal expsoure for the moment.  No doubt a long exposure was used, but not longer than normal for the circumstances, IMHO.', '2005-08-04 15:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586941, 211169, 41522, '<td valign="top">I find this to be striking.  The power of the water is evident and the composition is good.</td>', 'I find this to be striking.  The power of the water is evident and the composition is good.', '2005-08-04 15:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1586944, 210448, 41522, '<td valign="top">Excellent dramatic effect.  It has the feeling of the soul leaving the drown girls body.  So you got high points from me for the dramatic effect of the long esposure, but you lost a little for the brightness of the tub.  The tub is a bit distracting from your main subject.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-09 10:47:46.</i></td>', 'Excellent dramatic effect.  It has the feeling of the soul leaving the drown girls body.  So you got high points from me for the dramatic effect of the long esposure, but you lost a little for the brightness of the tub.  The tub is a bit distracting from your main subject.', '2005-08-04 15:26:19.000000', '2005-08-09 11:47:46.000000', 1),
(1587012, 210298, 31443, '<td valign="top">Aha! Knew it GF marvellicious!</td>', 'Aha! Knew it GF marvellicious!', '2005-08-04 15:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587015, 210837, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry and shadows, like it lots!</td>', 'Nice symmetry and shadows, like it lots!', '2005-08-04 15:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587018, 210726, 31443, '<td valign="top">So crisp yet overall soft and clear, love this image!</td>', 'So crisp yet overall soft and clear, love this image!', '2005-08-04 15:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587020, 211400, 31443, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful and yet serene, glad you had the movement on the person and the wooden part...</td>', 'This is so beautiful and yet serene, glad you had the movement on the person and the wooden part...', '2005-08-04 15:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587027, 210355, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice capture.  just a hair overexposted.  just a personal perference but i would have liked the blur on just the foreground or the background.  i''m thinking bluring the background while keeping the horse more in focus with a pan would have worked the best.  perhaps you tried that and it''s easier said than done as the feet move faster than the body.  so maybe concentraiting on the head would have been easier. just some thoughts from someone who has never tried this technique and needs to do so before posting comments.</td>', 'nice capture.  just a hair overexposted.  just a personal perference but i would have liked the blur on just the foreground or the background.  i''m thinking bluring the background while keeping the horse more in focus with a pan would have worked the best.  perhaps you tried that and it''s easier said than done as the feet move faster than the body.  so maybe concentraiting on the head would have been easier. just some thoughts from someone who has never tried this technique and needs to do so before posting comments.', '2005-08-04 16:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587038, 209156, 31443, '<td valign="top">That''s scary, got to give you credit for inventiveness!</td>', 'That''s scary, got to give you credit for inventiveness!', '2005-08-04 16:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587043, 211016, 31443, '<td valign="top">Would love to try this, fascinating stuff, this must have been exposed for hours!</td>', 'Would love to try this, fascinating stuff, this must have been exposed for hours!', '2005-08-04 16:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587046, 211492, 41522, '<td valign="top">This is cool.  Sort of moody.  Not fond of the square framing, but that is my only complaint.</td>', 'This is cool.  Sort of moody.  Not fond of the square framing, but that is my only complaint.', '2005-08-04 16:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587048, 211821, 31443, '<td valign="top">This must be in Iceland! Sulfur painted rocks...has to be..</td>', 'This must be in Iceland! Sulfur painted rocks...has to be..', '2005-08-04 16:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587049, 209384, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''ve never done ir so i assume this required a long shutter.  perhaps it was taken at night though for me it''s tough to tell by just looking at the pic as the shadows seem extremely prominent.  composition wise i would have liked to see more done with it, expecially the amount of sky vs ground as it currently seems unbalanced.</td>', 'i''ve never done ir so i assume this required a long shutter.  perhaps it was taken at night though for me it''s tough to tell by just looking at the pic as the shadows seem extremely prominent.  composition wise i would have liked to see more done with it, expecially the amount of sky vs ground as it currently seems unbalanced.', '2005-08-04 16:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587053, 209692, 31443, '<td valign="top">Very pretty! I like this image but there is a slight movement on the rocks as well, never mind, it''s very nice anyway</td>', 'Very pretty! I like this image but there is a slight movement on the rocks as well, never mind, it''s very nice anyway', '2005-08-04 16:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587057, 211895, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice use of long shutter.  personally i would have cropped down to remove the tree, only because the light really emphasizes it and draws the eye out of the pic.  nothing much you could have done about the dark water between the foreground and the falls.  i think it would have been cooler if it was silver as well to contrast it better from the mossy rock.  i guess you would have had to do some creative dodging in photoshop for that.</td>', 'nice use of long shutter.  personally i would have cropped down to remove the tree, only because the light really emphasizes it and draws the eye out of the pic.  nothing much you could have done about the dark water between the foreground and the falls.  i think it would have been cooler if it was silver as well to contrast it better from the mossy rock.  i guess you would have had to do some creative dodging in photoshop for that.', '2005-08-04 16:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587065, 210816, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like your composition.  the exposure is good.  i wish the water was a bit clearer, perhaps it just wasn''t calm enough.   i would have liked to see more color rather than the orange cast, i just feel there isn''t enough of a range of tones to make it work and not lose some dynamicness.</td>', 'i like your composition.  the exposure is good.  i wish the water was a bit clearer, perhaps it just wasn''t calm enough.   i would have liked to see more color rather than the orange cast, i just feel there isn''t enough of a range of tones to make it work and not lose some dynamicness.', '2005-08-04 16:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587076, 211677, 38725, '<td valign="top">Don''t know quite how you caught this shot but WOW, fantastic, well done :)</td>', 'Don''t know quite how you caught this shot but WOW, fantastic, well done :)', '2005-08-04 16:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587077, 211873, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice white balance, i like that this isn''t yellow.  the composition could use some work. i know you were just goofing around, but the cold facet merging with the spout is something i would have tried to avoid, even on a spoof shot as it makes the photo a little less pleasing to look at.</td>', 'nice white balance, i like that this isn''t yellow.  the composition could use some work. i know you were just goofing around, but the cold facet merging with the spout is something i would have tried to avoid, even on a spoof shot as it makes the photo a little less pleasing to look at.', '2005-08-04 16:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587083, 210979, 38725, '<td valign="top">Very nice, one of my favorites from this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice, one of my favorites from this challenge.', '2005-08-04 16:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1587084, 210821, 38725, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, my favorite from this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, my favorite from this challenge.', '2005-08-04 16:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
