(1588014, 210983, 19952, '<td valign="top">The angle works well for this shot and the colors are really nice and rich. There might be a little bit too much sky in this shot, but it''s still a really outstanding long exposure photo - one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'The angle works well for this shot and the colors are really nice and rich. There might be a little bit too much sky in this shot, but it''s still a really outstanding long exposure photo - one of the best in the challenge.', '2005-08-05 01:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
