(1588413, 210987, 14671, '<td valign="top">When submitting a photo you should check to see if its level. Even tho it is the precieved angle it is very distracting and can be corrected with a rotation or some sort.  In this case I would have rotated the image about 2 degrees CW.  This would have made the horizon centered and less appealing so I would have also then had to change to crop.  I also find the focus s a little off/out.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'When submitting a photo you should check to see if its level. Even tho it is the precieved angle it is very distracting and can be corrected with a rotation or some sort.  In this case I would have rotated the image about 2 degrees CW.  This would have made the horizon centered and less appealing so I would have also then had to change to crop.  I also find the focus s a little off/out.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-08-05 09:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588418, 211758, 14671, '<td valign="top">A lot of noise in the photo.  Enough that I find it takes away more then adds (if it was intentional).  It is a nice double exposure and fits the challenge well but not my kind of photo.  Double exposures have been a little to over done lately IMO even tho this is one of the better ones I''ve seen.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'A lot of noise in the photo.  Enough that I find it takes away more then adds (if it was intentional).  It is a nice double exposure and fits the challenge well but not my kind of photo.  Double exposures have been a little to over done lately IMO even tho this is one of the better ones I''ve seen.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-08-05 09:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588425, 211386, 14671, '<td valign="top">When submitting a photo for a challenge it would be wise to check the angle.  In this photo the angle appears to be off by at least 1 degree CCW and it is very distracting.  You can see what I mean in the building.  Even thos it is a night shot the focus is a little off as well.  Most Cameras have a hard time focusing at night so you may have to reshoot the same photo a couple of times to get the image in focus.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'When submitting a photo for a challenge it would be wise to check the angle.  In this photo the angle appears to be off by at least 1 degree CCW and it is very distracting.  You can see what I mean in the building.  Even thos it is a night shot the focus is a little off as well.  Most Cameras have a hard time focusing at night so you may have to reshoot the same photo a couple of times to get the image in focus.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-08-05 09:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588432, 211777, 14671, '<td valign="top">As an abstract its kinda interesting but I''m not fond of it as a challenge entry.  I find the photo does very little for creative inspiration.  I do like the way the cab makes it seem like its popping out tho.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'As an abstract its kinda interesting but I''m not fond of it as a challenge entry.  I find the photo does very little for creative inspiration.  I do like the way the cab makes it seem like its popping out tho.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-08-05 09:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588440, 211821, 14671, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Its nice to see an image of running water that doesn''t look over-neat imaged.  I like the vibrant colors in the stream and you''ve seem to manage to shoot the wet rocks with superb crispness and clarity.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Its nice to see an image of running water that doesn''t look over-neat imaged.  I like the vibrant colors in the stream and you''ve seem to manage to shoot the wet rocks with superb crispness and clarity.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <8>', '2005-08-05 09:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588442, 211576, 14671, '<td valign="top">"friut" is spelled fruit.  Altho the photo does meet the challenge I find the photo to be pretty boring.  It looks like a last minute kinda entry because of the subjects involved.  The photo is also noisey and a little to dark for my liking.  It is however an interesting way of photographing fruit.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', '"friut" is spelled fruit.  Altho the photo does meet the challenge I find the photo to be pretty boring.  It looks like a last minute kinda entry because of the subjects involved.  The photo is also noisey and a little to dark for my liking.  It is however an interesting way of photographing fruit.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-08-05 09:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588446, 209669, 14671, '<td valign="top">I like the green.  It is definiately unique.  The photo looks to be over sharpened.  You can see what I mean by looking at the "rail-road depot" sign hanging on the building.  It seems to be popping out more then the rest of the photo and is very distracting.  I do like how you''ve managed to capture the stars in the background.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I like the green.  It is definiately unique.  The photo looks to be over sharpened.  You can see what I mean by looking at the "rail-road depot" sign hanging on the building.  It seems to be popping out more then the rest of the photo and is very distracting.  I do like how you''ve managed to capture the stars in the background.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-08-05 09:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588452, 211644, 14671, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo for this challenge.  My only suggestion for this photo would have been for a tighter crop (to the persons elbows) to allow for a bigger entery and not so centered of a shot.  I think this ould have a greater impact to the viewers.    Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Interesting photo for this challenge.  My only suggestion for this photo would have been for a tighter crop (to the persons elbows) to allow for a bigger entery and not so centered of a shot.  I think this ould have a greater impact to the viewers.    Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <6>', '2005-08-05 09:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
