(1590378, 211322, 14671, '<td valign="top">Either you should have used a tripod or you gotta stop moving it when shooting.  It honestly loks like this was hand held and it has a rush entery look about it.  It does fit the challenge but not a very god shot overall.  Good luck in this challenge. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Either you should have used a tripod or you gotta stop moving it when shooting.  It honestly loks like this was hand held and it has a rush entery look about it.  It does fit the challenge but not a very god shot overall.  Good luck in this challenge. <5>', '2005-08-06 04:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590379, 210465, 14671, '<td valign="top">As interesting as the photo is I don''t like it.  I''m not sure if its the clarity issue or the brightness level.  Perhaps a little slower shutter speed would have made for a better photo.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'As interesting as the photo is I don''t like it.  I''m not sure if its the clarity issue or the brightness level.  Perhaps a little slower shutter speed would have made for a better photo.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-08-06 04:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
