(1590382, 209914, 14671, '<td valign="top">I bet this gets slammed for the lack of obvious exposure time.  It does fit the challenge and I think its very well done.  I like seeing shots where the ocean meets the sky.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I bet this gets slammed for the lack of obvious exposure time.  It does fit the challenge and I think its very well done.  I like seeing shots where the ocean meets the sky.  Good luck in this challenge.  <7>', '2005-08-06 04:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
