(1590386, 211886, 14671, '<td valign="top">wow what a big border.  I find the border is a little to big and takes away from the photo.  Funny enought this isn''t the first time someone has tried to do this style shot in this challenge.  It also seems that the only one in good focus in the one on the left.  The other 2 have a hazey look to them.  Good luck in this challenge. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'wow what a big border.  I find the border is a little to big and takes away from the photo.  Funny enought this isn''t the first time someone has tried to do this style shot in this challenge.  It also seems that the only one in good focus in the one on the left.  The other 2 have a hazey look to them.  Good luck in this challenge. <5>', '2005-08-06 04:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590389, 209997, 14671, '<td valign="top">The photo seems a little OoF.  Its also hard to tell that the photo fits the challenge.  Not a photo I''d hang on my wall.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;4&gt;</td>', 'The photo seems a little OoF.  Its also hard to tell that the photo fits the challenge.  Not a photo I''d hang on my wall.  Good luck in this challenge.  <4>', '2005-08-06 04:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
