(1590412, 211821, 25433, '<td valign="top">Well exposed, but I feel its over saturated in the orange colours bottom left. Otherwise a dynamic image.</td>', 'Well exposed, but I feel its over saturated in the orange colours bottom left. Otherwise a dynamic image.', '2005-08-06 04:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
