(1590419, 211611, 25433, '<td valign="top">Love the car lights, famous location helps with identifing too. Did you use a cokin-style star filter or is that flare normal?</td>', 'Love the car lights, famous location helps with identifing too. Did you use a cokin-style star filter or is that flare normal?', '2005-08-06 04:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590420, 211016, 25433, '<td valign="top">Awesome, so glad there is a strails exposure. I REALLY wanted to enter one myself, but wasn''t gifted one clear evening during the challenge dates. Technicallly good exposure, and definitly long.... say 10mins? However I would have appreciated some forground reference. Also looks to be massively fisheyed.... maybe its just me.</td>', 'Awesome, so glad there is a strails exposure. I REALLY wanted to enter one myself, but wasn''t gifted one clear evening during the challenge dates. Technicallly good exposure, and definitly long.... say 10mins? However I would have appreciated some forground reference. Also looks to be massively fisheyed.... maybe its just me.', '2005-08-06 04:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590422, 210927, 25433, '<td valign="top">Naked bums... Always a great subject matter :) but perhaps a bit (deliberatley?) soft to appease most voters.</td>', 'Naked bums... Always a great subject matter :) but perhaps a bit (deliberatley?) soft to appease most voters.', '2005-08-06 04:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590425, 210135, 25433, '<td valign="top">Big ups for the technical effort, but it is quite noisy. I know this is hard to avoid on most digi-cams.</td>', 'Big ups for the technical effort, but it is quite noisy. I know this is hard to avoid on most digi-cams.', '2005-08-06 04:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590428, 210977, 25433, '<td valign="top">Hands look like they are swimming! Composition is a bit odd. Quite abstract.</td>', 'Hands look like they are swimming! Composition is a bit odd. Quite abstract.', '2005-08-06 04:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590433, 211692, 25433, '<td valign="top">Thats great motion blur, particularly with the curve in the rail, I would like to have seen the train composed to be dominant in the frame, the well lighted street tends to draw the eye. Also more exposed to show a little more light on the blur.</td>', 'Thats great motion blur, particularly with the curve in the rail, I would like to have seen the train composed to be dominant in the frame, the well lighted street tends to draw the eye. Also more exposed to show a little more light on the blur.', '2005-08-06 04:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590436, 210474, 25433, '<td valign="top">Great composition, finds foreground reference where others lack. Imagine flowing star trails, that would have made this image particularly special!</td>', 'Great composition, finds foreground reference where others lack. Imagine flowing star trails, that would have made this image particularly special!', '2005-08-06 04:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590439, 211861, 25433, '<td valign="top">I can only assume that this was moving roses with a first or second curtain flash.... A little bit soft for my liking.</td>', 'I can only assume that this was moving roses with a first or second curtain flash.... A little bit soft for my liking.', '2005-08-06 04:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590443, 211721, 25433, '<td valign="top">Awesome, so pleased to see another star trails exposure. I only wished the trails were longer. Foreground reference makes this image. Cheers.</td>', 'Awesome, so pleased to see another star trails exposure. I only wished the trails were longer. Foreground reference makes this image. Cheers.', '2005-08-06 05:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590445, 209669, 25433, '<td valign="top">Curious as to whether this was colour shifted green, or captured green in the first place. Interesting subject.</td>', 'Curious as to whether this was colour shifted green, or captured green in the first place. Interesting subject.', '2005-08-06 05:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590448, 211873, 25433, '<td valign="top">Good concept, somehow lacking the punch I needed. Maybe some more post processing could have added more impact.</td>', 'Good concept, somehow lacking the punch I needed. Maybe some more post processing could have added more impact.', '2005-08-06 05:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590450, 211673, 25433, '<td valign="top">I really get a sense of depth in this image. Kinda looks like a cathedral or castle in the middle.</td>', 'I really get a sense of depth in this image. Kinda looks like a cathedral or castle in the middle.', '2005-08-06 05:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
