(1591694, 210448, 14671, '<td valign="top">nicely done.  The tattoo on the left breast is very distracting and the tub looks a little to bright.  I like the lack of color and find it compliments the facial expressions of the model in the tub.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'nicely done.  The tattoo on the left breast is very distracting and the tub looks a little to bright.  I like the lack of color and find it compliments the facial expressions of the model in the tub.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <8>', '2005-08-07 00:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591709, 210138, 14671, '<td valign="top">I like the absence of color or the tint of blue in this case.  The fingers look a little to busy for my liking and I can''t help to think that if the were a little less busy it would have been more contemporary which IMO would have made for a nice photo.  As it is being so busy It''s not a shot I''d hang on my wall.  The photo is composed well and does fit the challenge and I like the way the keys draw your eyes into the photo. Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'I like the absence of color or the tint of blue in this case.  The fingers look a little to busy for my liking and I can''t help to think that if the were a little less busy it would have been more contemporary which IMO would have made for a nice photo.  As it is being so busy It''s not a shot I''d hang on my wall.  The photo is composed well and does fit the challenge and I like the way the keys draw your eyes into the photo. Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <6>', '2005-08-07 01:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591718, 210355, 14671, '<td valign="top">I find this photo to have a major clarity issue.  I believe its caused by the brightness and contrast level.  Try bringing down the brightness by -5 or -10 and uping the contrast by +5 or +10.  I think you''ll find a more vibrant photo with less blur (I''m not refering to the background or the horses legs).  Good luck in this challenge. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I find this photo to have a major clarity issue.  I believe its caused by the brightness and contrast level.  Try bringing down the brightness by -5 or -10 and uping the contrast by +5 or +10.  I think you''ll find a more vibrant photo with less blur (I''m not refering to the background or the horses legs).  Good luck in this challenge. <5>', '2005-08-07 01:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591723, 211465, 14671, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot and very well done.  I would have liked to see a little higher on the image and a little less negative space on the right but well done regardless.  God luck in this challenge.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Interesting shot and very well done.  I would have liked to see a little higher on the image and a little less negative space on the right but well done regardless.  God luck in this challenge.  <7>', '2005-08-07 01:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
