(1591743, 211517, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I''ve been trying to do similar shots lately and out of 175 photos I think I got 3 strikes so far.  I find the sky is a little to much and not enough of the ground.  even when trying to shoot lightening you have to remember the RoT.  You could also have cropped a lot from the top and made if look a little more panaramic.  Either way I like it.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Nice capture.  I''ve been trying to do similar shots lately and out of 175 photos I think I got 3 strikes so far.  I find the sky is a little to much and not enough of the ground.  even when trying to shoot lightening you have to remember the RoT.  You could also have cropped a lot from the top and made if look a little more panaramic.  Either way I like it.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <7>', '2005-08-07 01:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
