(1591937, 211213, 30364, '<td valign="top">I love this.  I don''t know what it is that you actually photographed, but the result is an image that fits your title perfectly.  7</td>', 'I love this.  I don''t know what it is that you actually photographed, but the result is an image that fits your title perfectly.  7', '2005-08-07 03:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591941, 209941, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very appealing minimalist style.  The image unequivocally suggests wind, rain and a subject struggling to cope with it.  The exposure is well chosen for the subject  and the point you''re making.  Plus nice composition and deft processing.  7</td>', 'Very appealing minimalist style.  The image unequivocally suggests wind, rain and a subject struggling to cope with it.  The exposure is well chosen for the subject  and the point you''re making.  Plus nice composition and deft processing.  7', '2005-08-07 03:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591943, 210448, 30364, '<td valign="top">Glenn Close, I guess.  It''s a very effective use of long exposure.   I also like the graphic, high-contrast look you''ve gone for.  And the two facial expressions are each perfect for their "part".  Well done.  7</td>', 'Glenn Close, I guess.  It''s a very effective use of long exposure.   I also like the graphic, high-contrast look you''ve gone for.  And the two facial expressions are each perfect for their "part".  Well done.  7', '2005-08-07 04:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591945, 210882, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely crisp image showing several of the more interesting effects of a longer exposure at night; the beautiful deep sky, the repetition of the pools of light on the footpath, and the reflections of the other lights, etc.  Also a very fine composition, well photographed and nicely processed.  8</td>', 'Lovely crisp image showing several of the more interesting effects of a longer exposure at night; the beautiful deep sky, the repetition of the pools of light on the footpath, and the reflections of the other lights, etc.  Also a very fine composition, well photographed and nicely processed.  8', '2005-08-07 04:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591951, 210726, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is terrific.  Great idea, inspired location, good composition, perfect crop, nice exposure, effective processing.  Not much else to say, after all that.  Bravo!  8</td>', 'This is terrific.  Great idea, inspired location, good composition, perfect crop, nice exposure, effective processing.  Not much else to say, after all that.  Bravo!  8', '2005-08-07 04:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591957, 210738, 30364, '<td valign="top">Really effective use of a longer exposure, and equally impressive use of the brain.  Shows that there can be a lot more to long exposure than whirling sparklers or snaking car tail lights.  Congratulations on producing this thoughtful, restrained, sympathetic study of your subject(s).  9</td>', 'Really effective use of a longer exposure, and equally impressive use of the brain.  Shows that there can be a lot more to long exposure than whirling sparklers or snaking car tail lights.  Congratulations on producing this thoughtful, restrained, sympathetic study of your subject(s).  9', '2005-08-07 04:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591964, 211400, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very effective and unusual.  It''s clever, because the visually interesting part of the subject is the bell itself, and you''ve given us the opportunity to see it clearly (well, it''s a tiny bit soft, but not enough to ruin the effect).  Thus the blurred image of the bell ringer and his donger has two effects; it concentrates our attention on the bell, and it rings the bell (almost).  8</td>', 'Very effective and unusual.  It''s clever, because the visually interesting part of the subject is the bell itself, and you''ve given us the opportunity to see it clearly (well, it''s a tiny bit soft, but not enough to ruin the effect).  Thus the blurred image of the bell ringer and his donger has two effects; it concentrates our attention on the bell, and it rings the bell (almost).  8', '2005-08-07 04:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591973, 210057, 30364, '<td valign="top">Interesting and effective.  The tones are terrific.  The figure looks striking against the just-barely-there backdrop (which I assume is just a room in strong sunlight).  Also love the square crop, which is unusual but arresting for this otherwise vertical subject.  Makes for a really powerful composition.  8</td>', 'Interesting and effective.  The tones are terrific.  The figure looks striking against the just-barely-there backdrop (which I assume is just a room in strong sunlight).  Also love the square crop, which is unusual but arresting for this otherwise vertical subject.  Makes for a really powerful composition.  8', '2005-08-07 04:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591976, 210946, 25355, '<td valign="top">His name''s Cerberus, the 12th Labour of Hercules.</td>', 'His name''s Cerberus, the 12th Labour of Hercules.', '2005-08-07 04:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591980, 210425, 30364, '<td valign="top">Got my attention.  It''s very powerful, even without the terrific, disturbing title.  Is it a relection in a window?  Is that a light switch?  Why is it there?  Are those knees, in the bottom half of the image?  Who never notices you?  That''s why I like it so much ... it''s visually arresting and it raises more questions than it answers.  My definition of art. 9</td>', 'Got my attention.  It''s very powerful, even without the terrific, disturbing title.  Is it a relection in a window?  Is that a light switch?  Why is it there?  Are those knees, in the bottom half of the image?  Who never notices you?  That''s why I like it so much ... it''s visually arresting and it raises more questions than it answers.  My definition of art. 9', '2005-08-07 04:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591988, 211491, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love Karmann Ghias.  This is a very nice photograph; super composition/crop (especially as you presumably had to set the composition up in advance).  Also love the reflected columns in the fender.  The long exposure element is OK, just enough for movement.  Simple but effective.  7</td>', 'Love Karmann Ghias.  This is a very nice photograph; super composition/crop (especially as you presumably had to set the composition up in advance).  Also love the reflected columns in the fender.  The long exposure element is OK, just enough for movement.  Simple but effective.  7', '2005-08-07 04:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591996, 210837, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is my clear favourite, and my only 10.  The pure graphic quality of it is stunning.  I like the fact that the subject is descending (escalator?  No, probably stairs?).  The composition, the exposure and the processing are all perfect.  But the absolute winner for me, the real knockout blow, is the totally stationary hand!  That''s brilliant, and for me it makes the entire image revolve about that point, as if the hand is anchored in another dimension.  Bravo!</td>', 'This is my clear favourite, and my only 10.  The pure graphic quality of it is stunning.  I like the fact that the subject is descending (escalator?  No, probably stairs?).  The composition, the exposure and the processing are all perfect.  But the absolute winner for me, the real knockout blow, is the totally stationary hand!  That''s brilliant, and for me it makes the entire image revolve about that point, as if the hand is anchored in another dimension.  Bravo!', '2005-08-07 04:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592004, 211292, 41940, '<td valign="top">Stellar color and lighting</td>', 'Stellar color and lighting', '2005-08-07 04:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592039, 211169, 36903, '<td valign="top">now this is how water pictures should be made... i especially like the "water dust" (whats the word) at the top of the picture.. well done!</td>', 'now this is how water pictures should be made... i especially like the "water dust" (whats the word) at the top of the picture.. well done!', '2005-08-07 06:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592048, 211559, 16531, '<td valign="top">Cool shot of the Casino Niagara</td>', 'Cool shot of the Casino Niagara', '2005-08-07 07:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592051, 211425, 27763, '<td valign="top">Very spooky. 8.</td>', 'Very spooky. 8.', '2005-08-07 07:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592054, 211759, 39850, '<td valign="top">''8'' - Nice shot.  Criticism (with the caveat I know squat about long exposures) ; I keep viewing this photo with the lighthouse ''out'' (using my hand in front of eye to crop) and, although I do like the unusual green, and its combination with the blue, for me, this would be a better photograph without the lighthouse.  I like it as is but in my opinion, it would give it a more ''mysterious'' feel with just the ''dark rocks'' and the foggy sea.  An overall nice ''feel'' to this photograph - the only other criticism would be that I would like to have seen it larger (but yes I know difficult with the horizontal angle and width constraints for the Challenge).</td>', '''8'' - Nice shot.  Criticism (with the caveat I know squat about long exposures) ; I keep viewing this photo with the lighthouse ''out'' (using my hand in front of eye to crop) and, although I do like the unusual green, and its combination with the blue, for me, this would be a better photograph without the lighthouse.  I like it as is but in my opinion, it would give it a more ''mysterious'' feel with just the ''dark rocks'' and the foggy sea.  An overall nice ''feel'' to this photograph - the only other criticism would be that I would like to have seen it larger (but yes I know difficult with the horizontal angle and width constraints for the Challenge).', '2005-08-07 07:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592068, 211479, 30364, '<td valign="top">There''s just enough time exposure effect on the water, especially around the central rock and the post just offshore of the rock, to achieve your goal of animating the ocean surface.  The composition is also effective and appealing.  7</td>', 'There''s just enough time exposure effect on the water, especially around the central rock and the post just offshore of the rock, to achieve your goal of animating the ocean surface.  The composition is also effective and appealing.  7', '2005-08-07 08:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592070, 210453, 30364, '<td valign="top">Striking shot.  And very interesting, too.  I love the three stages of blur ... the people are moving fastest and so blur the most, then there''s the upper part of the structure with "medium" blur, and finally the relatively stationary pedestal part with minimal blur.  Kepler''s Law of Carnival Motion.  7</td>', 'Striking shot.  And very interesting, too.  I love the three stages of blur ... the people are moving fastest and so blur the most, then there''s the upper part of the structure with "medium" blur, and finally the relatively stationary pedestal part with minimal blur.  Kepler''s Law of Carnival Motion.  7', '2005-08-07 08:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592072, 211500, 30364, '<td valign="top">Best firework shot I''ve seen, but your image has many other interesting qualities as well.  The lights of the city, especially along the waterfront (well, the bottom; I think it''s a waterfront) are beautiful.  And the sky is just awesome.  Also, the composition is very good, as of course is the in-camera and post-camera execution.   A memorable photograph.  7</td>', 'Best firework shot I''ve seen, but your image has many other interesting qualities as well.  The lights of the city, especially along the waterfront (well, the bottom; I think it''s a waterfront) are beautiful.  And the sky is just awesome.  Also, the composition is very good, as of course is the in-camera and post-camera execution.   A memorable photograph.  7', '2005-08-07 08:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592075, 211760, 30364, '<td valign="top">Odd ... I love everything about this except for the ghostly figure.  Obviously, that figure was the whole point of your image, and you''ve done it very well.  It''s just that I believe this is such a lovely photograph without the person.  Beautiful detail, restrained and original composition, and so much of interest.  The foreground rocks ... rock!  I love the glimpse of breakers to the right, and of course the treatment and placement of the house against the marvellous sky.  Without the figure (and in another challenge, I guess) I''d vote 10.  This way, and this challenge, 7.</td>', 'Odd ... I love everything about this except for the ghostly figure.  Obviously, that figure was the whole point of your image, and you''ve done it very well.  It''s just that I believe this is such a lovely photograph without the person.  Beautiful detail, restrained and original composition, and so much of interest.  The foreground rocks ... rock!  I love the glimpse of breakers to the right, and of course the treatment and placement of the house against the marvellous sky.  Without the figure (and in another challenge, I guess) I''d vote 10.  This way, and this challenge, 7.', '2005-08-07 08:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592078, 209692, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  You won''t like this, but I would like your photograph even more if the rock was not there.  The breaking wave is so beautifully captured, with a time exposure perfectly judged for the purpose, that it deserves the entire stage to itself.  7</td>', 'Beautiful.  You won''t like this, but I would like your photograph even more if the rock was not there.  The breaking wave is so beautifully captured, with a time exposure perfectly judged for the purpose, that it deserves the entire stage to itself.  7', '2005-08-07 08:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592082, 210371, 30364, '<td valign="top">Unusual and interesting.  You''ll probably be criticised for this lovely, quiet image ... people will be looking for more primitive expressions of long exposure (streaky car lights and so forth).  But I hope I''m wrong and that this well composed and absorbing night shot is not overlooked.  7</td>', 'Unusual and interesting.  You''ll probably be criticised for this lovely, quiet image ... people will be looking for more primitive expressions of long exposure (streaky car lights and so forth).  But I hope I''m wrong and that this well composed and absorbing night shot is not overlooked.  7', '2005-08-07 09:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592084, 209823, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well, I love the simple elegance of the composition.  It''s harmonious and balanced, in an asymmetrical kind of way.  I also don''t mind that the image is so soft; I think that''s appropriate to the character of the scene (and of course to this challenge).  I''m afraid I don''t like the hand ... it seems pointless to me and robs the scene of some of its charm.  I suppose you were concerned that without a blindingly obvious time exposure gimmick, DPC commentators would attack you for "not meeting challenge".  Alas, you''re probably right.  6</td>', 'Well, I love the simple elegance of the composition.  It''s harmonious and balanced, in an asymmetrical kind of way.  I also don''t mind that the image is so soft; I think that''s appropriate to the character of the scene (and of course to this challenge).  I''m afraid I don''t like the hand ... it seems pointless to me and robs the scene of some of its charm.  I suppose you were concerned that without a blindingly obvious time exposure gimmick, DPC commentators would attack you for "not meeting challenge".  Alas, you''re probably right.  6', '2005-08-07 09:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592085, 211711, 22689, '<td valign="top">I like the soft tones , they are warm and give charm to your photo.</td>', 'I like the soft tones , they are warm and give charm to your photo.', '2005-08-07 09:15:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1592113, 211792, 29154, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of the falls and wonderful colors .... 7</td>', 'Beautiful capture of the falls and wonderful colors .... 7', '2005-08-07 10:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592138, 211855, 18219, '<td valign="top">I''VE VOTED ON HALF OF THE ENTRIES AND THIS IS MY FAVORITE SO FAR</td>', 'I''VE VOTED ON HALF OF THE ENTRIES AND THIS IS MY FAVORITE SO FAR', '2005-08-07 10:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592139, 210561, 18219, '<td valign="top">very abstract!!!!</td>', 'very abstract!!!!', '2005-08-07 10:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592159, 209895, 37544, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favs in the challenge! Good luck!</td>', 'This is one of my favs in the challenge! Good luck!', '2005-08-07 11:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592161, 211760, 37544, '<td valign="top">Top 3, if not the BLUE RIBBON--outstanding!!</td>', 'Top 3, if not the BLUE RIBBON--outstanding!!', '2005-08-07 11:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592166, 211794, 37544, '<td valign="top">the colors here are great! I am getting dizzy! Where you trying to confuse the voters?</td>', 'the colors here are great! I am getting dizzy! Where you trying to confuse the voters?', '2005-08-07 11:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592169, 210738, 37544, '<td valign="top">very magical and peaceful! I love it--good luck</td>', 'very magical and peaceful! I love it--good luck', '2005-08-07 11:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592171, 210973, 37544, '<td valign="top">very creepy! love the setting you choose.</td>', 'very creepy! love the setting you choose.', '2005-08-07 11:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592174, 211849, 37544, '<td valign="top">You look like you were flying!!! Backwards!!</td>', 'You look like you were flying!!! Backwards!!', '2005-08-07 11:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592176, 211548, 37544, '<td valign="top">perfect circle, great photo, just wish that the fire had more red or orange in the color of it. Nice bg!!</td>', 'perfect circle, great photo, just wish that the fire had more red or orange in the color of it. Nice bg!!', '2005-08-07 11:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592178, 211454, 37544, '<td valign="top">very neat effect!! Will be in top 20 for sure!!!</td>', 'very neat effect!! Will be in top 20 for sure!!!', '2005-08-07 11:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592180, 211357, 37544, '<td valign="top">is that a slinky? NIce modern abstract.</td>', 'is that a slinky? NIce modern abstract.', '2005-08-07 11:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592184, 210440, 37544, '<td valign="top">One of my favs in the challenge, but I think choosing three poses was too many--doesn''t change my vote though...great job and good luck!</td>', 'One of my favs in the challenge, but I think choosing three poses was too many--doesn''t change my vote though...great job and good luck!', '2005-08-07 11:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592186, 210138, 37544, '<td valign="top">great idea and I think that the blue tone works perfect here!! Good luck!</td>', 'great idea and I think that the blue tone works perfect here!! Good luck!', '2005-08-07 11:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592188, 211871, 37544, '<td valign="top">psycho!!! Great picture!! LOL</td>', 'psycho!!! Great picture!! LOL', '2005-08-07 11:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592192, 211558, 37544, '<td valign="top">very cool, i like it</td>', 'very cool, i like it', '2005-08-07 11:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592193, 211550, 37544, '<td valign="top">great color and lighting!!! just beautiful!!!</td>', 'great color and lighting!!! just beautiful!!!', '2005-08-07 11:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592197, 211400, 37544, '<td valign="top">I like this, I just with that more of the man was in focus, I guess that was hard to do, what do I know, this challenge was my first attempt at this technique</td>', 'I like this, I just with that more of the man was in focus, I guess that was hard to do, what do I know, this challenge was my first attempt at this technique', '2005-08-07 11:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592206, 210977, 37544, '<td valign="top">this reminds me of Disney''s Fantasia!! Mickey Mouse on a Acid Trip!!! No, really it is a nice picture, my only suggestion would have been to shoot the hands in an upright postion instead of across the frame. Good Luck</td>', 'this reminds me of Disney''s Fantasia!! Mickey Mouse on a Acid Trip!!! No, really it is a nice picture, my only suggestion would have been to shoot the hands in an upright postion instead of across the frame. Good Luck', '2005-08-07 11:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592279, 211213, 35804, '<td valign="top">A very appealing abstract...so soothing and calm...very nice.</td>', 'A very appealing abstract...so soothing and calm...very nice.', '2005-08-07 12:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592281, 211798, 35804, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this image...it''s so very intriguing...mysterious...and nicely subtle. The darkness  I think enhances the "dreamlike" quality...it lends a certain vague essence that dreams often have...nicely done.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this image...it''s so very intriguing...mysterious...and nicely subtle. The darkness  I think enhances the "dreamlike" quality...it lends a certain vague essence that dreams often have...nicely done.', '2005-08-07 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592284, 211828, 35804, '<td valign="top">What a spooky and fun image...either you''re about to split in two or some bit of alien is trying to escape...very cool.</td>', 'What a spooky and fun image...either you''re about to split in two or some bit of alien is trying to escape...very cool.', '2005-08-07 12:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592285, 211896, 35804, '<td valign="top">...I feel like I''ve seen this before... a very haunting image... lovely deep blues and greens.</td>', '...I feel like I''ve seen this before... a very haunting image... lovely deep blues and greens.', '2005-08-07 12:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592341, 211292, 10370, '<td valign="top">Looks like a very short exposure to me! Crimpled sticker on the bottom of one piece is distracting</td>', 'Looks like a very short exposure to me! Crimpled sticker on the bottom of one piece is distracting', '2005-08-07 13:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592355, 211900, 8125, '<td valign="top">Part of taking long exposure photographs is making sure your subject doesn''t look like it was taken out of focus.  In this case, I think that''s what happened.</td>', 'Part of taking long exposure photographs is making sure your subject doesn''t look like it was taken out of focus.  In this case, I think that''s what happened.', '2005-08-07 14:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592356, 211788, 8125, '<td valign="top">Wow, now that is an interesting element to the traditional long exposure waterfall.  That is probably the strongest point to this shot since everything else is dark it''s hard to see the other things that make up interest in a waterfall such as the rocks and foliage.  I''m very curious to see the details about this one when the challenge is up.  :-)  Nice work on the water!</td>', 'Wow, now that is an interesting element to the traditional long exposure waterfall.  That is probably the strongest point to this shot since everything else is dark it''s hard to see the other things that make up interest in a waterfall such as the rocks and foliage.  I''m very curious to see the details about this one when the challenge is up.  :-)  Nice work on the water!', '2005-08-07 14:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592359, 211628, 8125, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what effect you were going for when inverting this shot so the street is upside down and at the top of the frame.  You did meet the challenge though ...</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what effect you were going for when inverting this shot so the street is upside down and at the top of the frame.  You did meet the challenge though ...', '2005-08-07 14:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592360, 211894, 8125, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this an appealing use of the long exposure technique.  Typically in a shot like this, I would want to see one part of it in focus and stopped.  Otherwise, it just appears to be a blurry photo that was an accident.</td>', 'I don''t find this an appealing use of the long exposure technique.  Typically in a shot like this, I would want to see one part of it in focus and stopped.  Otherwise, it just appears to be a blurry photo that was an accident.', '2005-08-07 14:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592363, 211493, 8125, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  This is a great use of the long exposure technique.  My only wish is that I could see more of the rocks and such - but really that''s just being picky.  Very nice work.  I like the use of b/w here too... it has a very Ansel Adams feel to it.</td>', 'Beautiful!  This is a great use of the long exposure technique.  My only wish is that I could see more of the rocks and such - but really that''s just being picky.  Very nice work.  I like the use of b/w here too... it has a very Ansel Adams feel to it.', '2005-08-07 14:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592369, 211871, 1031, '<td valign="top">Subtle contrasts give it the look of a charcoal drawing--nice effect.</td>', 'Subtle contrasts give it the look of a charcoal drawing--nice effect.', '2005-08-07 14:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592373, 210135, 1031, '<td valign="top">Surprisingly legible--nice work!</td>', 'Surprisingly legible--nice work!', '2005-08-07 14:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592378, 211900, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hahaha--reminds me of a funny event from the early ''70s, when my high-school buddy and I each had ten year old Citroens.</td>', 'Hahaha--reminds me of a funny event from the early ''70s, when my high-school buddy and I each had ten year old Citroens.', '2005-08-07 14:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592380, 211759, 8125, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what time of day this was taken, but I wonder if just after sunrise or just before sunset would have been better?  There seems to be a lot of detail lost since it is so dark.  Also, the green of the lighthouse really overpowers the photo for me.</td>', 'I''m not sure what time of day this was taken, but I wonder if just after sunrise or just before sunset would have been better?  There seems to be a lot of detail lost since it is so dark.  Also, the green of the lighthouse really overpowers the photo for me.', '2005-08-07 14:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592382, 210298, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of effects; tricky choreography.</td>', 'Nice combination of effects; tricky choreography.', '2005-08-07 14:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592386, 211790, 8125, '<td valign="top">You have met the challenge, and done a nice job with the lighting/long exposure.  My suggestion for this photo would be to include more of the surroundings.  One of the great things about long exposure water shots is that it really enhances the beauty of what is around it and I don''t often find that it should be the only element of the photo.</td>', 'You have met the challenge, and done a nice job with the lighting/long exposure.  My suggestion for this photo would be to include more of the surroundings.  One of the great things about long exposure water shots is that it really enhances the beauty of what is around it and I don''t often find that it should be the only element of the photo.', '2005-08-07 14:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592388, 210882, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice scene, I like the glow of the walkway lights and the waterway leading through the image.</td>', 'This is a very nice scene, I like the glow of the walkway lights and the waterway leading through the image.', '2005-08-07 14:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592389, 211312, 1031, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of those nested dolls ... nice effect.</td>', 'Reminds me of those nested dolls ... nice effect.', '2005-08-07 14:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592393, 209799, 8125, '<td valign="top">The best element of this photo: the center of the flower.  The blurry bee in the middle of the image, the blown out highlights on the right side and the loss of detail on the petals hurt the image in my opinion.  I don''t know that this was a good subject for long exposure.</td>', 'The best element of this photo: the center of the flower.  The blurry bee in the middle of the image, the blown out highlights on the right side and the loss of detail on the petals hurt the image in my opinion.  I don''t know that this was a good subject for long exposure.', '2005-08-07 14:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592395, 210561, 8125, '<td valign="top">What exactly am I looking at?  It appears to be grass... the purple could be flowers?  Although you met the challenge, I don''t find the image appealing.</td>', 'What exactly am I looking at?  It appears to be grass... the purple could be flowers?  Although you met the challenge, I don''t find the image appealing.', '2005-08-07 14:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592414, 211500, 8125, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture... I love fireworks photos over a city line like this.  Now if only that cloud (or smoke) didn''t go right through the middle - but that''s being picky.</td>', 'Excellent capture... I love fireworks photos over a city line like this.  Now if only that cloud (or smoke) didn''t go right through the middle - but that''s being picky.', '2005-08-07 14:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592417, 210425, 8125, '<td valign="top">Very very interesting effect.  There is something dark and moody that I really like about this image.  Definately like the b/w treatment.  I actually think the plug receptacle helps this shot as well.  Very nice.</td>', 'Very very interesting effect.  There is something dark and moody that I really like about this image.  Definately like the b/w treatment.  I actually think the plug receptacle helps this shot as well.  Very nice.', '2005-08-07 14:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592419, 211760, 11738, '<td valign="top">The long exposure has created a very cool texture for the water.  Almost looks like ice.</td>', 'The long exposure has created a very cool texture for the water.  Almost looks like ice.', '2005-08-07 14:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592421, 209823, 11738, '<td valign="top">My question is why is that hand in the shot?  I just can''t figure out why it''s in the image.</td>', 'My question is why is that hand in the shot?  I just can''t figure out why it''s in the image.', '2005-08-07 14:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1592439, 210561, 36231, '<td valign="top">What hurts this photo is that I''m not sure what I''m looking at. I''m guessing it''s flowers, but it is both out of focus and very blurry.  Good luck!</td>', 'What hurts this photo is that I''m not sure what I''m looking at. I''m guessing it''s flowers, but it is both out of focus and very blurry.  Good luck!', '2005-08-07 15:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
