(1593241, 211733, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Chalenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 2/2<br/> <br/>Wow! This is a great shot, and a great idea too! I have no idea how you did it, but it is wonderful. The leading line, the perfect exposure, the blackness trapping the lighbulg, everything!<br/> <br/>I hope this takes a ribbon.</td>', 'Fit Chalenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 2/2 Wow! This is a great shot, and a great idea too! I have no idea how you did it, but it is wonderful. The leading line, the perfect exposure, the blackness trapping the lighbulg, everything! I hope this takes a ribbon.', '2005-08-08 00:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
