(1593479, 211759, 11738, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and comments folks.  It''s been since January 2005 that I have scored this well on a challenge.  I too thought it would have finished a bit higher in teh standings, but I am very pleased with the results.  Some mentioned that they didn''t like the colour of the light.  Well, that''s its real colour and I didn''t mess with that part of the image at all.  Looking back now, I probably could have tried for longer exposures to brighten up the water and foreground, but I think the lighthouse light would have become overpowering.</td>', 'Thanks for the votes and comments folks.  It''s been since January 2005 that I have scored this well on a challenge.  I too thought it would have finished a bit higher in teh standings, but I am very pleased with the results.  Some mentioned that they didn''t like the colour of the light.  Well, that''s its real colour and I didn''t mess with that part of the image at all.  Looking back now, I probably could have tried for longer exposures to brighten up the water and foreground, but I think the lighthouse light would have become overpowering.', '2005-08-08 01:26:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1593513, 211500, 28695, '<td valign="top">Oh, man.  I so wanted to shoot those fireworks for this challenge.  I was driving in from the suburbs when I saw them, but I didn''t have my camera with me.  A lovely shot.</td>', 'Oh, man.  I so wanted to shoot those fireworks for this challenge.  I was driving in from the suburbs when I saw them, but I didn''t have my camera with me.  A lovely shot.', '2005-08-08 01:34:15.000000', NULL, 0),
