(1594256, 211169, 20066, '<td valign="top">Sure you are a little bit dissapointed one place from ribbon again!<br/> <br/>But abotu the photo:  Cool how many different photos one can make of this waterfall!<br/> <br/>Edit:  Translation from Icelandic to English since it is supposed to be international!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-08 06:33:11.</i></td>', 'Sure you are a little bit dissapointed one place from ribbon again! But abotu the photo:  Cool how many different photos one can make of this waterfall! Edit:  Translation from Icelandic to English since it is supposed to be international!', '2005-08-08 07:31:06.000000', '2005-08-08 07:33:11.000000', 0),
(1594261, 211632, 23458, '<td valign="top">Hah... I knew this was a jj special!!<br/> <br/>and I''m proud of myself for getting it right - guessing Heida''s shot wasn''t exactly hard, but I''m surprised I had this one pegged.<br/> <br/>Anyway, I gave you a nine - and forgot to say I thought it was yours during the challenge.</td>', 'Hah... I knew this was a jj special!! and I''m proud of myself for getting it right - guessing Heida''s shot wasn''t exactly hard, but I''m surprised I had this one pegged. Anyway, I gave you a nine - and forgot to say I thought it was yours during the challenge.', '2005-08-08 07:38:55.000000', NULL, 0),
