(1594278, 211548, 9913, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Beagleboy:</b></div><hr/><i> Who''s in the picture?  Excellent result.  I knew this was going to score well. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>a friend of mine did this stunt for me:)<br/>he goes by the name SvartTrast on the internet<br/>here is another shot with him<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=191313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/9913/thumb/191313.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/9913/thumb/191313.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/9913/thumb/191313.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-08 07:15:24.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Beagleboy: Who''s in the picture?  Excellent result.  I knew this was going to score well.  a friend of mine did this stunt for me:)he goes by the name SvartTrast on the internethere is another shot with him', '2005-08-08 08:13:19.000000', '2005-08-08 08:15:24.000000', 0),
(1594279, 211169, 4281, '<td valign="top">eirasi, no I''m not at all disappointed with ending up in the 4th place yet again. I just find it a bit funny, that''s all! :)</td>', 'eirasi, no I''m not at all disappointed with ending up in the 4th place yet again. I just find it a bit funny, that''s all! :)', '2005-08-08 08:13:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1594285, 210726, 38032, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments.  I really wasn''t sure how people would react to this image and I was please with a top-ten finish..  It is sometimes difficult to create both something that "people" in general might like as well as something that I like!</td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments.  I really wasn''t sure how people would react to this image and I was please with a top-ten finish..  It is sometimes difficult to create both something that "people" in general might like as well as something that I like!', '2005-08-08 08:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
