(1594296, 211632, 36231, '<td valign="top">I scored this one as high as the blue ribbon winner.  Definitely does not deserve less than a 5! Sheesh! What''s wrong with some people! :)</td>', 'I scored this one as high as the blue ribbon winner.  Definitely does not deserve less than a 5! Sheesh! What''s wrong with some people! :)', '2005-08-08 08:27:08.000000', NULL, 0),
