(1594614, 210298, 28710, '<td valign="top">I think my favorite thing about this is quite simply the position of your strobe. The model is so well lit in initial position. Very nice.<br/> <br/>The shot by nazgul beats this because you can also see that he is standing on a picturesque rock. This is still totally amazingly great though!</td>', 'I think my favorite thing about this is quite simply the position of your strobe. The model is so well lit in initial position. Very nice. The shot by nazgul beats this because you can also see that he is standing on a picturesque rock. This is still totally amazingly great though!', '2005-08-08 11:05:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1594628, 211548, 5508, '<td valign="top">Unreal that someone gave this photo a 1. Some people on this site are on crack.</td>', 'Unreal that someone gave this photo a 1. Some people on this site are on crack.', '2005-08-08 11:15:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1594635, 211313, 28710, '<td valign="top">I think I will have to start calling you Mr. Lawrence from now on. I noticed something a little unexpected. There musician seems to be standing in the middle of some sort of glowy circle. <br/> <br/>Mystic indeed. Well done.</td>', 'I think I will have to start calling you Mr. Lawrence from now on. I noticed something a little unexpected. There musician seems to be standing in the middle of some sort of glowy circle.  Mystic indeed. Well done.', '2005-08-08 11:23:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1594640, 209269, 28710, '<td valign="top">I like this better than the other much higher placed shot. The other shot is burned out, but this has beautiful lighting throughout. The lightning is spidery and brightens a patch of sky. <br/> <br/>Be proud of this one.</td>', 'I like this better than the other much higher placed shot. The other shot is burned out, but this has beautiful lighting throughout. The lightning is spidery and brightens a patch of sky.  Be proud of this one.', '2005-08-08 11:25:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1594656, 211491, 28710, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture of a beautiful car. I had a 69 1/2 convertible a while back. Very possibly my favorite car of all time... with modifications of course.<br/> <br/>I like how the road indicates movement but the reflection is sharp and clear. This is a very good pic.</td>', 'Beautiful picture of a beautiful car. I had a 69 1/2 convertible a while back. Very possibly my favorite car of all time... with modifications of course. I like how the road indicates movement but the reflection is sharp and clear. This is a very good pic.', '2005-08-08 11:36:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1594669, 211548, 9913, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Fibre Optix:</b></div><hr/><i> Unreal that someone gave this photo a 1. Some people on this site are on crack. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am more amazed that so many ppl gave it a 10, I wonder what those people are on?</td>', 'Originally posted by Fibre Optix: Unreal that someone gave this photo a 1. Some people on this site are on crack.   I am more amazed that so many ppl gave it a 10, I wonder what those people are on?', '2005-08-08 11:44:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1594682, 211896, 41516, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, well deserved win!</td>', 'Beautiful image, well deserved win!', '2005-08-08 11:48:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1594798, 211720, 36881, '<td valign="top">I loved this pic, because the waterfall is so huge. I comment this one because I read the comments, and just laughed about ladymonarda comment. She says: ''Love the mushroom in the corner''. haha, there people ;) sorry, had to say something about it.</td>', 'I loved this pic, because the waterfall is so huge. I comment this one because I read the comments, and just laughed about ladymonarda comment. She says: ''Love the mushroom in the corner''. haha, there people ;) sorry, had to say something about it.', '2005-08-08 12:25:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1594820, 211306, 38592, '<td valign="top">For those that were wondering how this was done, it was actually pretty simple.  I set the camera on a tripod in a completely dark room with a 20sec exposure.  Pushed the shutter than exposed the green light by using a little key light thing.  Then I shut that off and turn on a flashlight in my other hand (which is why it is off screen) and exposed my body and face.  <br/> <br/>Very basic editing in photoshop, mostly consisting of curves and a bit of smudge on the green light and some blur.</td>', 'For those that were wondering how this was done, it was actually pretty simple.  I set the camera on a tripod in a completely dark room with a 20sec exposure.  Pushed the shutter than exposed the green light by using a little key light thing.  Then I shut that off and turn on a flashlight in my other hand (which is why it is off screen) and exposed my body and face.   Very basic editing in photoshop, mostly consisting of curves and a bit of smudge on the green light and some blur.', '2005-08-08 12:37:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1594830, 211896, 7291, '<td valign="top">So are we going to get the privelage of knowing how this was accomplished?</td>', 'So are we going to get the privelage of knowing how this was accomplished?', '2005-08-08 12:40:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1594838, 211357, 7291, '<td valign="top">What a great idea!  I personally prefer this one over the top 3.</td>', 'What a great idea!  I personally prefer this one over the top 3.', '2005-08-08 12:45:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1594839, 210330, 32754, '<td valign="top">John, this is a fantastic shot..it has such an aura and mystery to it...even though people have commented on the highlights, the image is original and fascinating..I still feel it belonged in top 10.</td>', 'John, this is a fantastic shot..it has such an aura and mystery to it...even though people have commented on the highlights, the image is original and fascinating..I still feel it belonged in top 10.', '2005-08-08 12:45:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1594849, 211709, 7291, '<td valign="top">Woohoo!</td>', 'Woohoo!', '2005-08-08 12:48:51.000000', NULL, 0),
