(1594924, 211895, 28394, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  I probably would have cropped out the tree in the top, and the water is slightly blown out.  I definitely like this shot though.</td>', 'I like the composition.  I probably would have cropped out the tree in the top, and the water is slightly blown out.  I definitely like this shot though.', '2005-08-08 13:06:34.000000', NULL, 0),
