(1594965, 211849, 6845, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by laurielblack:</b></div><hr/><i> I loved this shot... I think it''s underrated.  Wonderful!! :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by langdon:</b></div><hr/><i> Unbelievable you didn''t place higher, this was great.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ah shucks guys. You are too sweet. And thanks for the high praise.</td>', 'Originally posted by laurielblack: I loved this shot... I think it''s underrated.  Wonderful!! :)   Originally posted by langdon: Unbelievable you didn''t place higher, this was great.  Ah shucks guys. You are too sweet. And thanks for the high praise.', '2005-08-08 13:15:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1594967, 210837, 24642, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ubique:</b></div><hr/><i> 77th place!  When you look at most of the images that finished ahead of you, I guess you''ll consider jumping down those stairs yourself.  Either that or you''ll die laughing and just fall down.  Hope you''ve learned your lesson ...you KNOW you should have gone with the wiggly car tail lights and the whirling sparklers! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well I do jump up and down these stairs 5 days a week and it''s me on the photograph :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by ubique: 77th place!  When you look at most of the images that finished ahead of you, I guess you''ll consider jumping down those stairs yourself.  Either that or you''ll die laughing and just fall down.  Hope you''ve learned your lesson ...you KNOW you should have gone with the wiggly car tail lights and the whirling sparklers!   Well I do jump up and down these stairs 5 days a week and it''s me on the photograph :-)', '2005-08-08 13:16:01.000000', NULL, 0),
