(1596902, 211214, 39349, '<td valign="top">AWE, I must have looked at this photo for a good 10 minutes. I just couldn''t figure out what it was I was looking through. Now it all makes sense! I wish I could have figured it out durrning the challenge. I would have voted higher. (FYI I gave you a 5)<br/> <br/>What would I change now that I know what it is? Well, I''m really not sure, there are a few hot spots in the middle of the bubble maybe some PS burning to darken a bit? What if any post processing did you do to your photo?</td>', 'AWE, I must have looked at this photo for a good 10 minutes. I just couldn''t figure out what it was I was looking through. Now it all makes sense! I wish I could have figured it out durrning the challenge. I would have voted higher. (FYI I gave you a 5) What would I change now that I know what it is? Well, I''m really not sure, there are a few hot spots in the middle of the bubble maybe some PS burning to darken a bit? What if any post processing did you do to your photo?', '2005-08-09 01:20:06.000000', NULL, 0),
