(1597809, 211792, 12160, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by lennyV:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice picture living in Buffalo,NY most of the my younger life I knew the view right away. I do have to ask did you do a little color inhancement. I thought you might have because I don''t remember the colors always being so vibrant. I also would have given it a ten had I been able to vote. I now live in Richmond Va so seeing the falls lit up my day. Best of luck.<br/>   LennyV </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hi Lenny,<br/> <br/>Thanks for the comment. I did a little bit of color saturation on the photo but in reality the colors are just as vibrant as these, maybe a little less. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by lennyV: Nice picture living in Buffalo,NY most of the my younger life I knew the view right away. I do have to ask did you do a little color inhancement. I thought you might have because I don''t remember the colors always being so vibrant. I also would have given it a ten had I been able to vote. I now live in Richmond Va so seeing the falls lit up my day. Best of luck.   LennyV   Hi Lenny, Thanks for the comment. I did a little bit of color saturation on the photo but in reality the colors are just as vibrant as these, maybe a little less. :)', '2005-08-09 13:15:58.000000', NULL, 0),
