(1659394, 210903, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea.  I think it lost something in the translation though.  I''m not trying to be harsh, just honest.  I love the idea of what I think you were trying to create based on the title, but the "ghost" images don''t have enough of the tumble out of the box to make it realistic (if you know what I mean).  They''ve got lots of "spill" but not enough of the transition from box to floor to make it plausible for the visually-oriented mind.  I think you''ve got a great point of reference and starting point (good contrast, lighting, &amp; color), but if you have some additional shots from this experiment, you might look for a version that contains more of this transition.  Hope I''m making sense.</td>', 'Very cool idea.  I think it lost something in the translation though.  I''m not trying to be harsh, just honest.  I love the idea of what I think you were trying to create based on the title, but the "ghost" images don''t have enough of the tumble out of the box to make it realistic (if you know what I mean).  They''ve got lots of "spill" but not enough of the transition from box to floor to make it plausible for the visually-oriented mind.  I think you''ve got a great point of reference and starting point (good contrast, lighting, & color), but if you have some additional shots from this experiment, you might look for a version that contains more of this transition.  Hope I''m making sense.', '2005-08-30 21:42:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1667713, 211454, 9747, '<td valign="top">This is great. I gave it an 8. You were right in using the revolving lighted ball. The way it cast interesting shadows on the lady''s face is purr-fect, and the streaks of the colored lights does indeed help achieve a feeling of movement. The harsh shadows on the model''s lower lip and neck/chest bothered me, but not overly so. Kudos on an excellent photograph! I''m amazed this didn''t end up on the top 10 or even 20.</td>', 'This is great. I gave it an 8. You were right in using the revolving lighted ball. The way it cast interesting shadows on the lady''s face is purr-fect, and the streaks of the colored lights does indeed help achieve a feeling of movement. The harsh shadows on the model''s lower lip and neck/chest bothered me, but not overly so. Kudos on an excellent photograph! I''m amazed this didn''t end up on the top 10 or even 20.', '2005-09-01 23:36:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1668663, 210821, 8860, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot and subject (if a little too heavy on NeatImage). The contrast of texture in this is actually quite bizarrely tangible.</td>', 'Wonderful shot and subject (if a little too heavy on NeatImage). The contrast of texture in this is actually quite bizarrely tangible.', '2005-09-02 10:58:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1674781, 211792, 43621, '<td valign="top">STUNNING!!!</td>', 'STUNNING!!!', '2005-09-05 01:57:49.000000', NULL, 0),
