(1715558, 210821, 14986, '<td valign="top">Wonderful job on this one.  I would like to see a little more dodge/burn to add some interest to the lighting, but 7 out of 200 tells me that it''s certainly great the way it is as well.  This one would make a nice print.</td>', 'Wonderful job on this one.  I would like to see a little more dodge/burn to add some interest to the lighting, but 7 out of 200 tells me that it''s certainly great the way it is as well.  This one would make a nice print.', '2005-09-17 00:18:53.000000', NULL, 0),
