(1792249, 210425, 42792, '<td valign="top">Under-rated.  This is so hauntingly sad.  If I look at it long enough, I would really end up with goose bumps!  Would love to know how you pulled it off.</td>', 'Under-rated.  This is so hauntingly sad.  If I look at it long enough, I would really end up with goose bumps!  Would love to know how you pulled it off.', '2005-10-18 10:01:22.000000', NULL, 0),
