(1846838, 211838, 2553, '<td valign="top">Oh Tater, I love this!  Haven''t had much time to hang around dpc, and I missed this one.  Wish I''d have been able to vote in the challenge, this would have been a top pic, no doubt.  <br/> <br/>Great placing in the challenge, congratulations!<br/> <br/>(I like the stars too!)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh Tater, I love this!  Haven''t had much time to hang around dpc, and I missed this one.  Wish I''d have been able to vote in the challenge, this would have been a top pic, no doubt.   Great placing in the challenge, congratulations! (I like the stars too!) ', '2005-11-08 07:09:54.000000', NULL, 0),
