(1891727, 211548, 9913, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Floffy:</b></div><hr/><i> Awesome! How the hell did you do that... maybe you write it below, but thats not the point ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>the guy had a robe with a burning cloth on the end of it which he swung in circles .....<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-23 06:03:54.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Floffy: Awesome! How the hell did you do that... maybe you write it below, but thats not the point ;)   the guy had a robe with a burning cloth on the end of it which he swung in circles .....', '2005-11-23 06:00:34.000000', '2005-11-23 06:03:54.000000', 0),
