(2143706, 211709, 27763, '<td valign="top">Very fun shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very fun shot.  Nicely done.', '2006-02-12 00:06:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2166667, 211758, 18219, '<td valign="top">yes, I like this too.<br/>very well done.<br/>I can''t be bothered to read through the other posts, so sorry if this comment is repetitive:<br/>I think what stops this shot from being a really great shot instead of just a great shot (an 8 instead of a 9 or a 10 if you will) is the light on the horizon.<br/>If you could have had the sky/background black, then it would have turned it up that extra notch needed to put it amongst the greats!!!!<br/>well done anyway.</td>', 'yes, I like this too.very well done.I can''t be bothered to read through the other posts, so sorry if this comment is repetitive:I think what stops this shot from being a really great shot instead of just a great shot (an 8 instead of a 9 or a 10 if you will) is the light on the horizon.If you could have had the sky/background black, then it would have turned it up that extra notch needed to put it amongst the greats!!!!well done anyway.', '2006-02-20 21:13:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2247562, 211679, 55140, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. The mystical look of the water is great.</td>', 'I love this shot. The mystical look of the water is great.', '2006-03-22 14:37:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2292838, 210821, 42995, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is an incredible shot!  Just the perfect colour, texture and tonality.  Fantastic.<br/> <br/>*faved*<br/></td>', 'Wow, this is an incredible shot!  Just the perfect colour, texture and tonality.  Fantastic. *faved*', '2006-04-06 21:05:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2308951, 211425, 55546, '<td valign="top">wow !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'wow !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2006-04-13 00:21:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2360396, 210837, 47117, '<td valign="top">What an odd perspective and feel. Makes it very interesting though!</td>', 'What an odd perspective and feel. Makes it very interesting though!', '2006-04-30 00:41:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391344, 210821, 48928, '<td valign="top">Great shot, you captured this perfectly.</td>', 'Great shot, you captured this perfectly.', '2006-05-08 00:21:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2410193, 211821, 42013, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! Love the warm tones on the rocks contrasting nicely with the greens/blues.  I think exposure could be bumped just a bit, but considering the dynamic range present, this is excellent.<br/> <br/>add: The thumbnail looks like there is a person standing in the middle of a rushing river.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-12 16:54:25.</i></td>', 'Nice shot! Love the warm tones on the rocks contrasting nicely with the greens/blues.  I think exposure could be bumped just a bit, but considering the dynamic range present, this is excellent. add: The thumbnail looks like there is a person standing in the middle of a rushing river.', '2006-05-12 17:53:18.000000', '2006-05-12 17:54:25.000000', 0),
(2429655, 211720, 27164, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I like how you included a person for scale, emphasizing the grandeur.  I''m not too fond of the blurred bushes in the lower-left (moving during exposure?) or the gray-brown border, but this is otherwise an excellent study in long exposure.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I like how you included a person for scale, emphasizing the grandeur.  I''m not too fond of the blurred bushes in the lower-left (moving during exposure?) or the gray-brown border, but this is otherwise an excellent study in long exposure.', '2006-05-18 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2458645, 210448, 33068, '<td valign="top">SO VERY COOl.  Please tell me how you did this.  Love everything about it.</td>', 'SO VERY COOl.  Please tell me how you did this.  Love everything about it.', '2006-05-26 00:57:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2495004, 210448, 39239, '<td valign="top">Actually won best of show for this piece in a local art show!!!</td>', 'Actually won best of show for this piece in a local art show!!!', '2006-06-07 14:47:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2539105, 211833, 35517, '<td valign="top">wow great shot... i love your processing.. very nice, ihope you have this hanging on your wall....</td>', 'wow great shot... i love your processing.. very nice, ihope you have this hanging on your wall....', '2006-06-21 23:54:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561814, 210821, 60236, '<td valign="top">Great photo, the only problem that i have with it is that on the bottom right hand side, it is very bright and draws attention to the eye.  I would tone down the whites a bit to but more emphasis on the rocks.  P.S. I think we are finnally even with comments...correct me if i am wrong.</td>', 'Great photo, the only problem that i have with it is that on the bottom right hand side, it is very bright and draws attention to the eye.  I would tone down the whites a bit to but more emphasis on the rocks.  P.S. I think we are finnally even with comments...correct me if i am wrong.', '2006-06-28 12:10:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2622744, 209692, 55738, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Gotta say I really like this one and think it was really underrated.  It looks like a photo with a drawing on it.  It is really excellent. I''m surprised you didn''t score better.   Ah well, there''s no accounting for taste.  Excellent shot though!</td>', 'Wow.  Gotta say I really like this one and think it was really underrated.  It looks like a photo with a drawing on it.  It is really excellent. I''m surprised you didn''t score better.   Ah well, there''s no accounting for taste.  Excellent shot though!', '2006-07-14 16:10:23.000000', NULL, 0),
